(656497, 68552, 18960, '<td valign="top">Great subject material with good composition. Go back and re-do this one on a bright day, or, if you want, pump up the color and contrast.</td>', 'Great subject material with good composition. Go back and re-do this one on a bright day, or, if you want, pump up the color and contrast.', '2004-04-07 02:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(656498, 68507, 18505, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  I like the composition very much.  I have always been intrigued with seeing objects through other objects and like that you were able to carry it through twice. I like the neutral colors as well.  Good luck on the challenge.  I hope you are one of the ribbon winners!!</td>', 'Very creative!  I like the composition very much.  I have always been intrigued with seeing objects through other objects and like that you were able to carry it through twice. I like the neutral colors as well.  Good luck on the challenge.  I hope you are one of the ribbon winners!!', '2004-04-07 02:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(656499, 68296, 19305, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot. Good choice for the muted color pallette. Composition is technical, yet appealing. Focus is immedately drawn to the wheel, yet the eye wanders to other interesting things in the image (but always back to the wheel--good eye direction). Image quality suffers a little on the bottom left portion of the wheel with some jaggies, but I think that is just the medium with which we''re working here (darned pixels).</td>', 'I like it a lot. Good choice for the muted color pallette. Composition is technical, yet appealing. Focus is immedately drawn to the wheel, yet the eye wanders to other interesting things in the image (but always back to the wheel--good eye direction). Image quality suffers a little on the bottom left portion of the wheel with some jaggies, but I think that is just the medium with which we''re working here (darned pixels).', '2004-04-07 02:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
