(656875, 68741, 16318, '<td valign="top">Truly a classic!!  Great photo!!!  My bags are packed and I''m ready for a road trip!<br/>10!</td>', 'Truly a classic!!  Great photo!!!  My bags are packed and I''m ready for a road trip!10!', '2004-04-07 08:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
