(656881, 68469, 15919, '<td valign="top">Seems to need a litle more or better lightning or longer exposure, then you can increase the contrast without getting this white spots on the front wheel (on the left) .  Also it seems to lack a litle sharpness.  But the subject is fine and the image is ok too.</td>', 'Seems to need a litle more or better lightning or longer exposure, then you can increase the contrast without getting this white spots on the front wheel (on the left) .  Also it seems to lack a litle sharpness.  But the subject is fine and the image is ok too.', '2004-04-07 09:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(656882, 67980, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good colorsaturation and balance.  Subject very fine but maybe lacks a litle sharpness.  Fine image.</td>', 'Good colorsaturation and balance.  Subject very fine but maybe lacks a litle sharpness.  Fine image.', '2004-04-07 09:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
