(656905, 68712, 19380, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but i think it suffers from having too many wheels. Well not too many just one that clashes with the rest of the scenery. The big white one, just doesnt seem to go with the rest. Still good, that just distracts a bit.</td>', 'Good picture, but i think it suffers from having too many wheels. Well not too many just one that clashes with the rest of the scenery. The big white one, just doesnt seem to go with the rest. Still good, that just distracts a bit.', '2004-04-07 10:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(656906, 68663, 19663, '<td valign="top">What a great shot.</td>', 'What a great shot.', '2004-04-07 10:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(656907, 68552, 9295, '<td valign="top">All in all a nice photo, but for this challenge, you might have found a way to make the wheel more of the focal point. It is dark and overshadowed by the size and color of the building. Maybe a different time of day or a sunnier day where the sun highlights it better?</td>', 'All in all a nice photo, but for this challenge, you might have found a way to make the wheel more of the focal point. It is dark and overshadowed by the size and color of the building. Maybe a different time of day or a sunnier day where the sun highlights it better?', '2004-04-07 10:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(656917, 68159, 19380, '<td valign="top">Ha, I really dig this one. Very creative concept, and very eye pleasing as well. One thing, i dunno if its just me or what, it feels just a tiny bit tilted. But everything else fits so well a miniscule tilt wont affect my vote. -8</td>', 'Ha, I really dig this one. Very creative concept, and very eye pleasing as well. One thing, i dunno if its just me or what, it feels just a tiny bit tilted. But everything else fits so well a miniscule tilt wont affect my vote. -8', '2004-04-07 10:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(656919, 68735, 9295, '<td valign="top">Love the concept, but the sand as a backdrop lessens the appeal.  Maybe if you could have shot from below the wheels towards a bright blue sky...?  Also, the middle wheel should not be cropped off at the bottom of the stick.</td>', 'Love the concept, but the sand as a backdrop lessens the appeal.  Maybe if you could have shot from below the wheels towards a bright blue sky...?  Also, the middle wheel should not be cropped off at the bottom of the stick.', '2004-04-07 10:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(656922, 68615, 19380, '<td valign="top">Wow i think its bloody amazing. It does so much in one shot, and everything is beautiful. Qualitys a bit off, but considering the size and everything on screen, i think its due to having to compress it at 150k. But i am very much loving it, my very first 10 in this challenge.</td>', 'Wow i think its bloody amazing. It does so much in one shot, and everything is beautiful. Qualitys a bit off, but considering the size and everything on screen, i think its due to having to compress it at 150k. But i am very much loving it, my very first 10 in this challenge.', '2004-04-07 10:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
