(657131, 68622, 9089, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to understand that is a cat behind the car, looked like a shaggy rug, I think the b&amp;w makes it harder to understand that it is a cat.</td>', 'Took me a while to understand that is a cat behind the car, looked like a shaggy rug, I think the b&w makes it harder to understand that it is a cat.', '2004-04-07 12:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(657132, 68317, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The strong colors of the tiny truch really pop.  The eye and its catchlight works well too.  Suggestions for improvement:  1) Try moving the "hole more off center and 2) The egg-shell color, fading to dark,  of the blurred pipe would be more effective if it had more pizzazz.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The strong colors of the tiny truch really pop.  The eye and its catchlight works well too.  Suggestions for improvement:  1) Try moving the "hole more off center and 2) The egg-shell color, fading to dark,  of the blurred pipe would be more effective if it had more pizzazz.', '2004-04-07 12:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(657134, 68545, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The green and yellow color pop, but the entire 1/4 of the picture at the bottom does nothing.  Try cropping the bacl out to fairly close to the loweset part of the yellow line.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The green and yellow color pop, but the entire 1/4 of the picture at the bottom does nothing.  Try cropping the bacl out to fairly close to the loweset part of the yellow line.', '2004-04-07 12:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
