(657168, 68745, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and good angel.  Maybe you should have give it a litle tighter croping from right and also I thing that litle more contrast wouldnt have hurt (maybe the reflection flairs get to much then?).</td>', 'Very sharp and good angel.  Maybe you should have give it a litle tighter croping from right and also I thing that litle more contrast wouldnt have hurt (maybe the reflection flairs get to much then?).', '2004-04-07 12:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
