(657179, 68218, 16648, '<td valign="top">different, +1 for that. flames overexposed, ambulance and other items not in sharp focus and as they are very foreground and a main part of the image, distracting not to be sharp. OOF helicopter is nice touch. Not a strong ''wheel'' theme though.</td>', 'different, +1 for that. flames overexposed, ambulance and other items not in sharp focus and as they are very foreground and a main part of the image, distracting not to be sharp. OOF helicopter is nice touch. Not a strong ''wheel'' theme though.', '2004-04-07 12:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
