(657385, 68760, 12661, '<td valign="top">Cute title. I like the play between light and shadow going on in this picture. Assuming this was actually a retired tire, breaking a spoke or two could have strenghtened the theme. As far as composition, I find the tight crop on the left to be the only negative. I would have prefered the entire tire included, but that may just be me. Nice job.</td>', 'Cute title. I like the play between light and shadow going on in this picture. Assuming this was actually a retired tire, breaking a spoke or two could have strenghtened the theme. As far as composition, I find the tight crop on the left to be the only negative. I would have prefered the entire tire included, but that may just be me. Nice job.', '2004-04-07 13:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(657387, 68194, 16230, '<td valign="top">I like it! I had a similar idea, but no time to work on it. You picked a good location, and the technical aspects are fine. A more caveman-like subject would help, as well as knocking off the corners of the ''wheels'' to make them a little rounder. Good job!</td>', 'I like it! I had a similar idea, but no time to work on it. You picked a good location, and the technical aspects are fine. A more caveman-like subject would help, as well as knocking off the corners of the ''wheels'' to make them a little rounder. Good job!', '2004-04-07 13:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(657388, 68306, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the light and the capture of water droplets with the quick shutter speed.  The composition doesn''t grab me.  Perhaps a vertical shot, or the wheel off center?</td>', 'I like the light and the capture of water droplets with the quick shutter speed.  The composition doesn''t grab me.  Perhaps a vertical shot, or the wheel off center?', '2004-04-07 13:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(657389, 68669, 18897, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but the only wheel I''m getting here is the title. It''s round, and so are most wheels, but to me the similarities ends there..</td>', 'I like the picture, but the only wheel I''m getting here is the title. It''s round, and so are most wheels, but to me the similarities ends there..', '2004-04-07 13:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(657390, 68502, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice demonstration of motion.  Like the limited color pallette.</td>', 'Nice demonstration of motion.  Like the limited color pallette.', '2004-04-07 13:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(657391, 67807, 18191, '<td valign="top">Crap, nice camera for a beginner---wish it was mine! : )!</td>', 'Crap, nice camera for a beginner---wish it was mine! : )!', '2004-04-07 13:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(657393, 68544, 12661, '<td valign="top">The balance between the lighting of the parked car works well with the delayed exposure lighting of the moving car. The only exception is the headlights visible to the right. They are just too bright and take the attention away from the rest of the focus. Without that, it would have really strengthened the photo. As far as meeting the challenge, well, there are wheels visible but the photo doesn''t really say "wheels". They are basically incidental to the photo, not the theme. No deduction, just an observation.</td>', 'The balance between the lighting of the parked car works well with the delayed exposure lighting of the moving car. The only exception is the headlights visible to the right. They are just too bright and take the attention away from the rest of the focus. Without that, it would have really strengthened the photo. As far as meeting the challenge, well, there are wheels visible but the photo doesn''t really say "wheels". They are basically incidental to the photo, not the theme. No deduction, just an observation.', '2004-04-07 13:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(657395, 68524, 16488, '<td valign="top">Subject is a nice find.  I feel the angle is disturbing without meaning to be.  Shadows cast by the flash don''t necessarily add to the composition.</td>', 'Subject is a nice find.  I feel the angle is disturbing without meaning to be.  Shadows cast by the flash don''t necessarily add to the composition.', '2004-04-07 13:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(657397, 68663, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like the color here.</td>', 'I like the color here.', '2004-04-07 13:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(657398, 68653, 16241, '<td valign="top">living dangerously?</td>', 'living dangerously?', '2004-04-07 13:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(657399, 68755, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.</td>', 'Interesting angle.', '2004-04-07 13:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(657400, 68561, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-04-07 13:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(657401, 68617, 16241, '<td valign="top">love the concept, seems a bit blurred though?</td>', 'love the concept, seems a bit blurred though?', '2004-04-07 13:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(657402, 68137, 16488, '<td valign="top">Just too small to be effective.  Brights are blown out.  However, the concept and overall pattern of the composition are interesting.</td>', 'Just too small to be effective.  Brights are blown out.  However, the concept and overall pattern of the composition are interesting.', '2004-04-07 13:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(657403, 68395, 16488, '<td valign="top">I so want this skate to stand up!</td>', 'I so want this skate to stand up!', '2004-04-07 13:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(657407, 68764, 18897, '<td valign="top">Hm, ok, bike found, camera up, picture taken.. Didn''t turn out very interesting though. <br/> <br/>You could perhaps have bent your knees a bit? Found an angle? Worked with an interesting crop? It has color going for it in a way, but in the end a lazy submission to me, sorry.</td>', 'Hm, ok, bike found, camera up, picture taken.. Didn''t turn out very interesting though.  You could perhaps have bent your knees a bit? Found an angle? Worked with an interesting crop? It has color going for it in a way, but in the end a lazy submission to me, sorry.', '2004-04-07 13:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(657408, 68274, 327, '<td valign="top">Good composition, light and splash of color. I think the compression is over done...? not sure of the cause. Still I like it.</td>', 'Good composition, light and splash of color. I think the compression is over done...? not sure of the cause. Still I like it.', '2004-04-07 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(657411, 68579, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. I think the color is off a bit because of the lighting. The olives are looking yellow. Maybe a bit of levels adjustment.</td>', 'Cute idea. I think the color is off a bit because of the lighting. The olives are looking yellow. Maybe a bit of levels adjustment.', '2004-04-07 13:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(657412, 68447, 16488, '<td valign="top">Rich color and good texture.  I feel the subject just isn''t there.</td>', 'Rich color and good texture.  I feel the subject just isn''t there.', '2004-04-07 13:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(657413, 68734, 16241, '<td valign="top">this is so cool................</td>', 'this is so cool................', '2004-04-07 13:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(657414, 68605, 12661, '<td valign="top">I find that silhouettes work well with simple shapes where the outline is key and the lighting method adds some drama to the photo. In this case, however, I feel that the sculpture has an element of depth that is lost by using this method. Given its complexity, I think that using front lighting would have given clues to where everything fits together in the sculpture. Then again, I am an engineer, not an artist, so how I look at this may be biased by my own interests. On a brighter note, the sky looks spectacular and the texture of the water is very well captured. If the subject was less intricate, it would have been perfect.</td>', 'I find that silhouettes work well with simple shapes where the outline is key and the lighting method adds some drama to the photo. In this case, however, I feel that the sculpture has an element of depth that is lost by using this method. Given its complexity, I think that using front lighting would have given clues to where everything fits together in the sculpture. Then again, I am an engineer, not an artist, so how I look at this may be biased by my own interests. On a brighter note, the sky looks spectacular and the texture of the water is very well captured. If the subject was less intricate, it would have been perfect.', '2004-04-07 13:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(657416, 68687, 16241, '<td valign="top">like the tripod !</td>', 'like the tripod !', '2004-04-07 13:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(657417, 68353, 327, '<td valign="top">Major wheel! Love the bright happy colors. Good entry.</td>', 'Major wheel! Love the bright happy colors. Good entry.', '2004-04-07 13:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(657418, 68123, 18897, '<td valign="top">Could have been a good one with proper focus and exposure. But on the up-side it has setup merits going for it.</td>', 'Could have been a good one with proper focus and exposure. But on the up-side it has setup merits going for it.', '2004-04-07 13:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(657419, 68599, 16241, '<td valign="top">scrap yard?</td>', 'scrap yard?', '2004-04-07 13:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(657420, 68597, 16488, '<td valign="top">The light is right, the concept is interesting.</td>', 'The light is right, the concept is interesting.', '2004-04-07 13:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(657421, 67980, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice colours</td>', 'nice colours', '2004-04-07 13:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(657424, 68365, 327, '<td valign="top">My favorite subject,  I never tire of looking at bikes. Nice shot on a rainy day, I like the black and white here.</td>', 'My favorite subject,  I never tire of looking at bikes. Nice shot on a rainy day, I like the black and white here.', '2004-04-07 13:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(657425, 68713, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice!   very nice</td>', 'nice!   very nice', '2004-04-07 13:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(657429, 68545, 327, '<td valign="top">I think your light could of been much better for this shot. A good idea, with good composition, but poor light and focus.</td>', 'I think your light could of been much better for this shot. A good idea, with good composition, but poor light and focus.', '2004-04-07 13:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(657430, 67943, 16230, '<td valign="top">The grass and twigs make the image a bit cluttered. It''s a nice subject, and well photographed too. A different setting, perhaps something with a different color in the background to make the wheel stand out more, might have looked better. Good job.</td>', 'The grass and twigs make the image a bit cluttered. It''s a nice subject, and well photographed too. A different setting, perhaps something with a different color in the background to make the wheel stand out more, might have looked better. Good job.', '2004-04-07 13:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(657433, 68594, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, the hands, wheels and tones are appeling. Not crazy for this heavy frame.</td>', 'I like this shot, the hands, wheels and tones are appeling. Not crazy for this heavy frame.', '2004-04-07 14:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(657434, 68541, 16488, '<td valign="top">The polished section of wheel interestes me--wish there were more of it in the image.</td>', 'The polished section of wheel interestes me--wish there were more of it in the image.', '2004-04-07 14:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(657437, 68741, 327, '<td valign="top">62? Awesome car. Someone really did a nice restoration job.</td>', '62? Awesome car. Someone really did a nice restoration job.', '2004-04-07 14:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(657438, 68590, 18897, '<td valign="top">Disturbing shadows and background. The lightning is harsh and the surface doesn''t seem to be white really, just over-exposed. Were you in a rush?</td>', 'Disturbing shadows and background. The lightning is harsh and the surface doesn''t seem to be white really, just over-exposed. Were you in a rush?', '2004-04-07 14:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(657439, 68663, 16488, '<td valign="top">The hub that blocks the cattle is, unfortunately, what draws my eye.  Perhaps a different point of view would benefit this subject.</td>', 'The hub that blocks the cattle is, unfortunately, what draws my eye.  Perhaps a different point of view would benefit this subject.', '2004-04-07 14:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(657442, 68560, 327, '<td valign="top">Got to watch that harsh sunlight. It will washout your shots. Maybe if taken early in the a.m. or late p.m. You''ll need to play with _your_ cameras settings/exposure to see what will work in this kind of light.</td>', 'Got to watch that harsh sunlight. It will washout your shots. Maybe if taken early in the a.m. or late p.m. You''ll need to play with _your_ cameras settings/exposure to see what will work in this kind of light.', '2004-04-07 14:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(657443, 68523, 16488, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  I like the light and the framing in the foreground with the out of focus plants.</td>', 'Pretty.  I like the light and the framing in the foreground with the out of focus plants.', '2004-04-07 14:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(657444, 67964, 18897, '<td valign="top">Excellent crop and very nice in b/w. The vertical shadow is perhaps a bit too dominant/sharp? Best bicycle wheel so far..</td>', 'Excellent crop and very nice in b/w. The vertical shadow is perhaps a bit too dominant/sharp? Best bicycle wheel so far..', '2004-04-07 14:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(657448, 68003, 18897, '<td valign="top">..we can tell</td>', '..we can tell', '2004-04-07 14:06:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(657449, 68058, 16488, '<td valign="top">Like your point of view.  The wheel on the right is bothersome--it attracts too much attention for my comfort.</td>', 'Like your point of view.  The wheel on the right is bothersome--it attracts too much attention for my comfort.', '2004-04-07 14:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(657451, 68036, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good motion blur with the water.  Composition seems a little tight.  Also, a slightly different angle showing the entire axle on the left to give a leading line into the image could possibly generate more impact.</td>', 'Good motion blur with the water.  Composition seems a little tight.  Also, a slightly different angle showing the entire axle on the left to give a leading line into the image could possibly generate more impact.', '2004-04-07 14:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(657453, 68395, 327, '<td valign="top">Technically this is fine, but the composition is blaah. Where is the other skate? The laces spread out would of added some interest, maybe a flower, glove, helmet.....something else is needed here.</td>', 'Technically this is fine, but the composition is blaah. Where is the other skate? The laces spread out would of added some interest, maybe a flower, glove, helmet.....something else is needed here.', '2004-04-07 14:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(657454, 68038, 18484, '<td valign="top">nice detail</td>', 'nice detail', '2004-04-07 14:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(657455, 68126, 18484, '<td valign="top">great sharpness</td>', 'great sharpness', '2004-04-07 14:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(657456, 68159, 16488, '<td valign="top">Somehow this reminds me of ballet....is that first position?</td>', 'Somehow this reminds me of ballet....is that first position?', '2004-04-07 14:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(657458, 68657, 18484, '<td valign="top">great concept!</td>', 'great concept!', '2004-04-07 14:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(657460, 68296, 18484, '<td valign="top">great lighting</td>', 'great lighting', '2004-04-07 14:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(657461, 68679, 19519, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful!  I couldn''t tell what it was at first.  I love the whole setup.  Great Job!</td>', 'This is just beautiful!  I couldn''t tell what it was at first.  I love the whole setup.  Great Job!', '2004-04-07 14:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(657462, 68653, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative shooting. Maybe a bit too much clover and not enough wheel?</td>', 'Creative shooting. Maybe a bit too much clover and not enough wheel?', '2004-04-07 14:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(657463, 68247, 7743, '<td valign="top">The angle of the lines on the tread adds tension to the image.  It appears to be overexposed.</td>', 'The angle of the lines on the tread adds tension to the image.  It appears to be overexposed.', '2004-04-07 14:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(657464, 68456, 18484, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle you used...effects the whole picture...well done!</td>', 'I really like the angle you used...effects the whole picture...well done!', '2004-04-07 14:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(657465, 68447, 18897, '<td valign="top">Came from a soft b/w shot into this one, and ouch.. Nice dramatic shot, just too much color/contrast, even after adjusting my eyes to it, making it an effort to sort things out. Still - a nice dramatic shot.</td>', 'Came from a soft b/w shot into this one, and ouch.. Nice dramatic shot, just too much color/contrast, even after adjusting my eyes to it, making it an effort to sort things out. Still - a nice dramatic shot.', '2004-04-07 14:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(657467, 68393, 18484, '<td valign="top">I think had you used the shadow available this would have been a stronger picture.</td>', 'I think had you used the shadow available this would have been a stronger picture.', '2004-04-07 14:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(657468, 68125, 18484, '<td valign="top">great shot!!</td>', 'great shot!!', '2004-04-07 14:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(657470, 68262, 17574, '<td valign="top">Not my cup of tea</td>', 'Not my cup of tea', '2004-04-07 14:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(657471, 68306, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is a tough lighting situation.  The bright areas on the right lead the eye away from the wheel and alot of the wheel is in shadow.  Unfortunately, to bring out the detail in the wheel you would have had to blow the highlights in the sky and water with basic editing.</td>', 'This is a tough lighting situation.  The bright areas on the right lead the eye away from the wheel and alot of the wheel is in shadow.  Unfortunately, to bring out the detail in the wheel you would have had to blow the highlights in the sky and water with basic editing.', '2004-04-07 14:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(657472, 68032, 16230, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! I think the photo would have been better if the whole boat were visible, even if there were more than 18 wheels. Still, I like it a lot the way it is. It''s one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'What a great idea! I think the photo would have been better if the whole boat were visible, even if there were more than 18 wheels. Still, I like it a lot the way it is. It''s one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-04-07 14:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
