(657502, 68679, 18897, '<td valign="top">And there I was thinking that if I see another mouse wheel I''ll mark it down to 1 just because. And now I can''t possibly.</td>', 'And there I was thinking that if I see another mouse wheel I''ll mark it down to 1 just because. And now I can''t possibly.', '2004-04-07 14:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
