(657867, 68553, 16004, '<td valign="top">If I had taken the shot, for personal choice I might have decided to be a little straight on to the subject - in order to get the background wheel within the circumference of the wheel in the foreground.  And I''m trying to bite my tongue, but I have to point out that it''s wonky.  The house in the background, though boring, is in keeping with the period feel of the cannon, so I think it''s relevant.  I think more focus on the wheels might also have made it more in keeping with the challenge.  Still an interesting subject though - 5 (6 if less wonky)</td>', 'If I had taken the shot, for personal choice I might have decided to be a little straight on to the subject - in order to get the background wheel within the circumference of the wheel in the foreground.  And I''m trying to bite my tongue, but I have to point out that it''s wonky.  The house in the background, though boring, is in keeping with the period feel of the cannon, so I think it''s relevant.  I think more focus on the wheels might also have made it more in keeping with the challenge.  Still an interesting subject though - 5 (6 if less wonky)', '2004-04-07 16:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(657868, 68394, 18403, '<td valign="top">Image seems washed out, but very nice composition.</td>', 'Image seems washed out, but very nice composition.', '2004-04-07 16:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
