(657890, 68667, 16004, '<td valign="top">The only problem with B&amp;W is that you can''t see if it''s rusty...  It''s a bit of an unusual angle, too, but I like the snow and (ignoring the rust issue) the B&amp;W gives an aged feel which works in this case.  Personally, it''s not particularly inspiring, but it fit''s the challenge well.  It could do with being larger though - you''re given 640 pixels and really those should be used to get the extra gravitas. 5.</td>', 'The only problem with B&W is that you can''t see if it''s rusty...  It''s a bit of an unusual angle, too, but I like the snow and (ignoring the rust issue) the B&W gives an aged feel which works in this case.  Personally, it''s not particularly inspiring, but it fit''s the challenge well.  It could do with being larger though - you''re given 640 pixels and really those should be used to get the extra gravitas. 5.', '2004-04-07 16:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
