(657953, 68571, 18868, '<td valign="top">really harsh flash lighting, and the shadow on the lower-left corner are a problem,  Perhaps using a difuser or bouncing the flash would help.</td>', 'really harsh flash lighting, and the shadow on the lower-left corner are a problem,  Perhaps using a difuser or bouncing the flash would help.', '2004-04-07 16:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(657954, 68684, 18868, '<td valign="top">I like the view.  Spending a few minutes cleaning it before you shoot it would be well worth the time.</td>', 'I like the view.  Spending a few minutes cleaning it before you shoot it would be well worth the time.', '2004-04-07 16:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(657956, 68576, 18403, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, dramatic shadows, sepia is perfect!</td>', 'Nice angle, dramatic shadows, sepia is perfect!', '2004-04-07 16:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(657957, 68655, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed macro.  I''m surprised that there aren''t more like this.</td>', 'Nicely executed macro.  I''m surprised that there aren''t more like this.', '2004-04-07 16:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(657959, 68561, 13035, '<td valign="top">Ouch!!!!!!!!!!!  rule of thirds could have helped a very interesting subject here.  6</td>', 'Ouch!!!!!!!!!!!  rule of thirds could have helped a very interesting subject here.  6', '2004-04-07 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(657960, 68716, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think you needed to crop off the sky - it''s just too bright</td>', 'I think you needed to crop off the sky - it''s just too bright', '2004-04-07 16:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(657961, 67769, 18403, '<td valign="top">Nice macro!</td>', 'Nice macro!', '2004-04-07 16:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(657963, 68025, 18868, '<td valign="top">Lots of potential -- harsh lighting and soft focus detract from score.</td>', 'Lots of potential -- harsh lighting and soft focus detract from score.', '2004-04-07 16:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(657964, 68308, 18403, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, great angle!</td>', 'Cute kid, great angle!', '2004-04-07 16:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(657967, 67901, 18868, '<td valign="top">Except that it''s not a Harley, and as all good motorcyclists know, "Hog" is a freakin'' *trademark* of HD.  Just bustin'' your chops -- and HD''s.  Nice shot, well lit.</td>', 'Except that it''s not a Harley, and as all good motorcyclists know, "Hog" is a freakin'' *trademark* of HD.  Just bustin'' your chops -- and HD''s.  Nice shot, well lit.', '2004-04-07 16:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(657968, 68194, 18403, '<td valign="top">Very cute!!!  Highlights kinda blown out, otherwise good!</td>', 'Very cute!!!  Highlights kinda blown out, otherwise good!', '2004-04-07 16:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(657969, 68365, 18868, '<td valign="top">LOL... good title!</td>', 'LOL... good title!', '2004-04-07 16:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(657970, 68741, 18403, '<td valign="top">A ''58 Chevy!!  Nicely done.</td>', 'A ''58 Chevy!!  Nicely done.', '2004-04-07 16:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(657971, 68768, 13035, '<td valign="top">What an interesting sillouette.  I would play with this some to bring more brightness and color to the sky, then that pinwheel would really jump off the page.  6</td>', 'What an interesting sillouette.  I would play with this some to bring more brightness and color to the sky, then that pinwheel would really jump off the page.  6', '2004-04-07 16:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(657972, 68274, 18757, '<td valign="top">Good idea...But aplication is not good...</td>', 'Good idea...But aplication is not good...', '2004-04-07 16:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(657973, 67860, 18868, '<td valign="top">Handsome -- maybe a little oversharpened.</td>', 'Handsome -- maybe a little oversharpened.', '2004-04-07 16:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(657974, 68576, 18757, '<td valign="top">Is it in Turkey???</td>', 'Is it in Turkey???', '2004-04-07 16:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(657977, 67647, 18757, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to be retired...!</td>', 'I don''t want to be retired...!', '2004-04-07 16:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(657978, 68126, 18403, '<td valign="top">The best of this genre!!</td>', 'The best of this genre!!', '2004-04-07 16:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(657979, 67807, 18403, '<td valign="top">Superb image quality!!!</td>', 'Superb image quality!!!', '2004-04-07 16:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(657980, 68131, 13035, '<td valign="top">striking subject.  I would would change my framing to to more of a standard rectangle, keep the entire subject whhel in the frame, put that center star on my right verticle third line and lose the hint of the other wheel on the left.  7</td>', 'striking subject.  I would would change my framing to to more of a standard rectangle, keep the entire subject whhel in the frame, put that center star on my right verticle third line and lose the hint of the other wheel on the left.  7', '2004-04-07 16:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(657981, 68753, 16106, '<td valign="top">Reflection is a nice touch, and you got great colors. My only knock has to do with applicability to the challenge. Is this a wheel? Round spinny thing, yes. But a wheel?</td>', 'Reflection is a nice touch, and you got great colors. My only knock has to do with applicability to the challenge. Is this a wheel? Round spinny thing, yes. But a wheel?', '2004-04-07 16:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(657982, 68745, 18757, '<td valign="top">Wonderful....</td>', 'Wonderful....', '2004-04-07 16:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(657983, 68215, 5364, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you needed to put a flag into this image</td>', 'I don''t understand why you needed to put a flag into this image', '2004-04-07 16:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(657984, 68716, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed..shows off the perspective to good advantage</td>', 'Nicely framed..shows off the perspective to good advantage', '2004-04-07 16:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(657985, 68169, 13035, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph.  I would frame even tighter and lose the the backgound in the lower right and left corners.  7</td>', 'Nice photograph.  I would frame even tighter and lose the the backgound in the lower right and left corners.  7', '2004-04-07 16:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(657986, 67982, 14603, '<td valign="top">Simply done with nice composition</td>', 'Simply done with nice composition', '2004-04-07 16:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(657987, 68571, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would have helped you here to loose the light coloured bracket at the top and the background on the right.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would have helped you here to loose the light coloured bracket at the top and the background on the right.', '2004-04-07 16:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(657988, 68194, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture! I love it! ... Mundi?</td>', 'Beautiful picture! I love it! ... Mundi?', '2004-04-07 16:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(657989, 68361, 13035, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  I would frame even tighter, and lose the left hub.  It''s distracting that the crop line cuts that hub through the middle.  7</td>', 'Nice concept.  I would frame even tighter, and lose the left hub.  It''s distracting that the crop line cuts that hub through the middle.  7', '2004-04-07 16:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(657990, 68008, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colour and composition</td>', 'Nice use of colour and composition', '2004-04-07 16:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(657991, 68423, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good use of colour and perspective</td>', 'Good use of colour and perspective', '2004-04-07 16:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(657992, 68169, 18403, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro, great lighting!</td>', 'Excellent macro, great lighting!', '2004-04-07 16:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(657993, 68131, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think I might have chopped the bottom off to remove the rail, otherwise a good image.</td>', 'I think I might have chopped the bottom off to remove the rail, otherwise a good image.', '2004-04-07 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(657995, 68537, 1368, '<td valign="top">Awsome picture! Lovely colors and lightning and pov,  perfect for my taste!  - 10</td>', 'Awsome picture! Lovely colors and lightning and pov,  perfect for my taste!  - 10', '2004-04-07 16:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(657997, 68058, 13035, '<td valign="top">I like your depth of field here.  I do feel a little out of balance with my eyr pulling right.  The out of focus wheel is cropped, combine that with the void on the left, and I feel a little jolted.  Move that camera six inches left for a balanced composition.  I like it!  6</td>', 'I like your depth of field here.  I do feel a little out of balance with my eyr pulling right.  The out of focus wheel is cropped, combine that with the void on the left, and I feel a little jolted.  Move that camera six inches left for a balanced composition.  I like it!  6', '2004-04-07 17:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(657999, 68370, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think I might have got down on the ground and photographed the trolly wheels closer, maybe including part of the bike wheel.</td>', 'I think I might have got down on the ground and photographed the trolly wheels closer, maybe including part of the bike wheel.', '2004-04-07 17:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(658004, 67980, 13035, '<td valign="top">I like that the wheel hub sits on left verticle third line.  Drop that hub to the lower horizontal third, and I think the composition would be perfect.  Nice shot.  7</td>', 'I like that the wheel hub sits on left verticle third line.  Drop that hub to the lower horizontal third, and I think the composition would be perfect.  Nice shot.  7', '2004-04-07 17:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(658006, 68678, 14603, '<td valign="top">Well composed and lit...9</td>', 'Well composed and lit...9', '2004-04-07 17:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(658008, 67993, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great textures across a very close series of tones A bit chaotic but quite evocatie.</td>', 'Great textures across a very close series of tones A bit chaotic but quite evocatie.', '2004-04-07 17:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(658009, 68725, 18403, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition, but a bit too dark.</td>', 'Terrific composition, but a bit too dark.', '2004-04-07 17:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(658011, 68544, 1368, '<td valign="top">I really think you should have skipped the stopped car I think it ruins alot in  the picture  I like the sky and the trees and thelight  trail, Did you take a picture without the car? Would like too see if you did, good luck :-)</td>', 'I really think you should have skipped the stopped car I think it ruins alot in  the picture  I like the sky and the trees and thelight  trail, Did you take a picture without the car? Would like too see if you did, good luck :-)', '2004-04-07 17:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(658012, 68741, 16106, '<td valign="top">Well exposed and composed but that just makes the red box with the reflective glass and the rest of the backround even more distractiong. If the backround was blank this would have been a contender.</td>', 'Well exposed and composed but that just makes the red box with the reflective glass and the rest of the backround even more distractiong. If the backround was blank this would have been a contender.', '2004-04-07 17:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(658013, 68580, 13035, '<td valign="top">depth of field is confusing here because of the drastic blur for the background on the left, to the slightly blurred background of the red building.  I think that with a static background, totally blurred or totally in focus, you would have more continuity.  Put the wheel hub into one of the rule of thirds cross-sections and you have a winner.  Great subject!  6</td>', 'depth of field is confusing here because of the drastic blur for the background on the left, to the slightly blurred background of the red building.  I think that with a static background, totally blurred or totally in focus, you would have more continuity.  Put the wheel hub into one of the rule of thirds cross-sections and you have a winner.  Great subject!  6', '2004-04-07 17:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(658014, 68504, 16318, '<td valign="top">Great photo!!  10</td>', 'Great photo!!  10', '2004-04-07 17:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(658017, 68129, 18403, '<td valign="top">Great photography!</td>', 'Great photography!', '2004-04-07 17:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(658018, 68759, 9089, '<td valign="top">Foreground detracts from the photo, ugly weeds, also I wouldn''t know it was a tricycle without seeing 3 wheels.</td>', 'Foreground detracts from the photo, ugly weeds, also I wouldn''t know it was a tricycle without seeing 3 wheels.', '2004-04-07 17:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(658019, 67856, 18403, '<td valign="top">Fabulous angle! Superb image quality.</td>', 'Fabulous angle! Superb image quality.', '2004-04-07 17:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(658021, 68192, 18403, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and great image quality.</td>', 'Lovely composition and great image quality.', '2004-04-07 17:17:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(658022, 68626, 16106, '<td valign="top">2 negative comments. Too small aposting take it near the limit of 640 and lower your DPI untill you triple the size ot this image. Secondly the house in the backround dosen''t help tell this story, and messes up the lines of the tricycle. If not for those two points this would be a very strong shot. I like the story you are telling, and I like the low POV you took, it adds a lot of drama. What if your modle was in the act of sitting down in the jeep looking back at the tryke? More drama is always better.</td>', '2 negative comments. Too small aposting take it near the limit of 640 and lower your DPI untill you triple the size ot this image. Secondly the house in the backround dosen''t help tell this story, and messes up the lines of the tricycle. If not for those two points this would be a very strong shot. I like the story you are telling, and I like the low POV you took, it adds a lot of drama. What if your modle was in the act of sitting down in the jeep looking back at the tryke? More drama is always better.', '2004-04-07 17:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(658024, 68711, 16106, '<td valign="top">Tires, wheels, almost the same thing. but not exactly.</td>', 'Tires, wheels, almost the same thing. but not exactly.', '2004-04-07 17:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(658025, 67856, 13035, '<td valign="top">great subject!  I think that using the rule of thirds could have helped your drama.  It would have given us an idea of what that cable wheel was spinning to, or spinning from.  6</td>', 'great subject!  I think that using the rule of thirds could have helped your drama.  It would have given us an idea of what that cable wheel was spinning to, or spinning from.  6', '2004-04-07 17:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(658027, 67943, 16106, '<td valign="top">good colors, but poor focus.</td>', 'good colors, but poor focus.', '2004-04-07 17:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(658028, 68348, 9089, '<td valign="top">Bright glare on the far left is bad for the photo.</td>', 'Bright glare on the far left is bad for the photo.', '2004-04-07 17:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(658030, 68537, 18403, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle and lighting! Terrific!</td>', 'Unusual angle and lighting! Terrific!', '2004-04-07 17:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(658031, 68625, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well exposed and converted, with a silky B&amp;W feel, but tires and whells are not the same thing. Of course if I had taken this shot I would have submitted it cause it is quite nice.</td>', 'Nice shot, well exposed and converted, with a silky B&W feel, but tires and whells are not the same thing. Of course if I had taken this shot I would have submitted it cause it is quite nice.', '2004-04-07 17:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(658032, 67979, 16106, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but too bloody small. You cheated yourself.</td>', 'Very nice, but too bloody small. You cheated yourself.', '2004-04-07 17:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(658033, 68567, 16004, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess a car might be defined as a set of wheels, but i think that''s pushing it a bit...  I like the Lancer - the latest Evo is a gorgeous rocket of a motor...  but, i don''t know - the wheels aren''t prominent enough IMHO to truly fit the spirit of the challenge, and the picture is a bit too noisy - the trail from the rear lights are a bit superfluous...  It might have been enhanced if it was only a still shot?  A bit of neatimage (freeware!) might have helped smooth it out too.</td>', 'Well, I guess a car might be defined as a set of wheels, but i think that''s pushing it a bit...  I like the Lancer - the latest Evo is a gorgeous rocket of a motor...  but, i don''t know - the wheels aren''t prominent enough IMHO to truly fit the spirit of the challenge, and the picture is a bit too noisy - the trail from the rear lights are a bit superfluous...  It might have been enhanced if it was only a still shot?  A bit of neatimage (freeware!) might have helped smooth it out too.', '2004-04-07 17:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(658035, 68594, 14603, '<td valign="top">Love the whole feel to this image.<br/>Best I`ve seen so far.....10</td>', 'Love the whole feel to this image.Best I`ve seen so far.....10', '2004-04-07 17:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(658036, 68221, 16318, '<td valign="top">Great photo!!  I love the scene : )  10</td>', 'Great photo!!  I love the scene : )  10', '2004-04-07 17:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(658037, 68731, 13035, '<td valign="top">think hard about borders.  more than not they distrct.  nice shot. 7</td>', 'think hard about borders.  more than not they distrct.  nice shot. 7', '2004-04-07 17:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(658039, 68679, 16106, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot but a bit too abstract and a long way to go to get to a mouse wheel, which is barely a wheel anyway. I like the image and was trying one way and onother to see what it was and when I finally saw it I was disapointed that it wasn''t a wheel wheel, had it been the payoff whould have been as high as the shot is pretty.</td>', 'Pretty shot but a bit too abstract and a long way to go to get to a mouse wheel, which is barely a wheel anyway. I like the image and was trying one way and onother to see what it was and when I finally saw it I was disapointed that it wasn''t a wheel wheel, had it been the payoff whould have been as high as the shot is pretty.', '2004-04-07 17:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(658040, 68189, 18403, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!!!</td>', 'Nicely done!!!', '2004-04-07 17:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(658042, 68605, 16106, '<td valign="top">Too dark, it has interesting massing but I can see no detail in the subject and the sky isn''t so glorious that it was worth the tradeoff.</td>', 'Too dark, it has interesting massing but I can see no detail in the subject and the sky isn''t so glorious that it was worth the tradeoff.', '2004-04-07 17:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(658043, 68695, 16106, '<td valign="top">The yelow of the oak and the reflections in the upper left hurt this compostion, putting too much attention away from your central focus.</td>', 'The yelow of the oak and the reflections in the upper left hurt this compostion, putting too much attention away from your central focus.', '2004-04-07 17:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(658044, 68394, 14603, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition..looking like the contrast could do with adjustment..that aside, perfect.....9</td>', 'Excellent composition..looking like the contrast could do with adjustment..that aside, perfect.....9', '2004-04-07 17:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(658046, 68628, 18403, '<td valign="top">Great idea, so what''s wrong?  Lighting, angle, and background.</td>', 'Great idea, so what''s wrong?  Lighting, angle, and background.', '2004-04-07 17:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(658047, 68597, 18403, '<td valign="top">Super image quality!!!</td>', 'Super image quality!!!', '2004-04-07 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(658048, 68720, 19168, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting, What are we looking at?</td>', 'It''s interesting, What are we looking at?', '2004-04-07 17:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(658051, 68010, 19519, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colors!</td>', 'Nice use of colors!', '2004-04-07 17:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(658052, 68768, 18403, '<td valign="top">Better than average pinwhee shot.  Better DOF would help.</td>', 'Better than average pinwhee shot.  Better DOF would help.', '2004-04-07 17:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(658054, 68437, 18403, '<td valign="top">Higher contrast would help this really clean image.</td>', 'Higher contrast would help this really clean image.', '2004-04-07 17:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(658055, 68731, 16829, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I think the border detracts from an otherwise fine picture.</td>', 'Sorry, but I think the border detracts from an otherwise fine picture.', '2004-04-07 17:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(658059, 67943, 15982, '<td valign="top">could have used a stronger focus, but a wonderful subject</td>', 'could have used a stronger focus, but a wonderful subject', '2004-04-07 17:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(658061, 68540, 9089, '<td valign="top">Image is a tad soft, and wish this would have shown those front wheels really off of the ground.</td>', 'Image is a tad soft, and wish this would have shown those front wheels really off of the ground.', '2004-04-07 17:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(658062, 68277, 9089, '<td valign="top">Image seems a little washed out, check your levels.</td>', 'Image seems a little washed out, check your levels.', '2004-04-07 17:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(658064, 68501, 18403, '<td valign="top">The 90 degree rotation did not help.  Otherwise a good clean image.</td>', 'The 90 degree rotation did not help.  Otherwise a good clean image.', '2004-04-07 17:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(658066, 68605, 9089, '<td valign="top">Top part of the silhouette looks good, but as you go down, it begins to get jumbled and lost in the trees in the background.</td>', 'Top part of the silhouette looks good, but as you go down, it begins to get jumbled and lost in the trees in the background.', '2004-04-07 17:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(658069, 67860, 9089, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, I see the spring, looking for a wheel.  I''m guessing it is the circle around the spring.  If the wheels had been a little clearer, and the watch centered on the pic, this would be one of my favorites of this challenge, but as it is having to search for a wheel, brings the score down.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, I see the spring, looking for a wheel.  I''m guessing it is the circle around the spring.  If the wheels had been a little clearer, and the watch centered on the pic, this would be one of my favorites of this challenge, but as it is having to search for a wheel, brings the score down.', '2004-04-07 17:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(658070, 68171, 18960, '<td valign="top">That is huge. We need as many Ferris Wheels (and water wheels) as can be stuffed into a competition just because they''re fun! This one is done well. Thank you.</td>', 'That is huge. We need as many Ferris Wheels (and water wheels) as can be stuffed into a competition just because they''re fun! This one is done well. Thank you.', '2004-04-07 17:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(658072, 68615, 18197, '<td valign="top">On close inspection, this is one of the most interesting photos in the wheels collection. I really like the juxtaposition of the reflected gallery and macabre machine. Nice subject matter artfully rendered.<br/> <br/>Where was it taken?</td>', 'On close inspection, this is one of the most interesting photos in the wheels collection. I really like the juxtaposition of the reflected gallery and macabre machine. Nice subject matter artfully rendered. Where was it taken?', '2004-04-07 17:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(658076, 68306, 18403, '<td valign="top">Composition great but too many highlights blown out on building.  An overcast sky might have helped or perhaps a different time of day. Still, a nice image.</td>', 'Composition great but too many highlights blown out on building.  An overcast sky might have helped or perhaps a different time of day. Still, a nice image.', '2004-04-07 17:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(658078, 68725, 9089, '<td valign="top">Rich looking, but maybe just a tad too dark.</td>', 'Rich looking, but maybe just a tad too dark.', '2004-04-07 17:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(658080, 68276, 18403, '<td valign="top">Great composition, but just a bit too much contrast.</td>', 'Great composition, but just a bit too much contrast.', '2004-04-07 17:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(658083, 68579, 16982, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  The dark background brings out the pasta nicely, but makes the glass difficult to see.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  The dark background brings out the pasta nicely, but makes the glass difficult to see.', '2004-04-07 17:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(658093, 68269, 18632, '<td valign="top">well cool, I love it but is that not cheating? Can you do that</td>', 'well cool, I love it but is that not cheating? Can you do that', '2004-04-07 18:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(658099, 68321, 6073, '<td valign="top">I think the cropping here was a little too tight.  Maybe a little breathing room on the bottom and/or the show the entire wheel on top?</td>', 'I think the cropping here was a little too tight.  Maybe a little breathing room on the bottom and/or the show the entire wheel on top?', '2004-04-07 18:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(658100, 68560, 6073, '<td valign="top">The exposure is a little blown out in the back.   Cool subject, but a different time of day may have made for better lighting.</td>', 'The exposure is a little blown out in the back.   Cool subject, but a different time of day may have made for better lighting.', '2004-04-07 18:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(658105, 68694, 6073, '<td valign="top">This is very flat.</td>', 'This is very flat.', '2004-04-07 18:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(658106, 68584, 16982, '<td valign="top">Very good photo!  The cheese at the back looks slightly like it''s floating, though, and there is a light fringe around the cheeses, possibly caused by sharpening.  nice, bright colours.</td>', 'Very good photo!  The cheese at the back looks slightly like it''s floating, though, and there is a light fringe around the cheeses, possibly caused by sharpening.  nice, bright colours.', '2004-04-07 18:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(658107, 68129, 6073, '<td valign="top">Finally a photo with some strong colors.  Well done</td>', 'Finally a photo with some strong colors.  Well done', '2004-04-07 18:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(658108, 68525, 16982, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  I would have liked to have the wheel a little closer and the trails disappearing off the left of the picture.</td>', 'Good idea!  I would have liked to have the wheel a little closer and the trails disappearing off the left of the picture.', '2004-04-07 18:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(658109, 68686, 19567, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool. But the tape holding the stencil up shows.</td>', 'Pretty cool. But the tape holding the stencil up shows.', '2004-04-07 18:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(658110, 68242, 16089, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, the only problem is those 2 cars in the backround.</td>', 'Very nice photo, the only problem is those 2 cars in the backround.', '2004-04-07 18:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(658111, 68006, 19567, '<td valign="top">Good perspective but more depth of field needed...</td>', 'Good perspective but more depth of field needed...', '2004-04-07 18:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(658113, 68714, 16004, '<td valign="top">I feel bad for the owner of the truck, but hey, I do like the photo!  I''m not always a fan of going B&amp;W, but i think in this case it kind of works...  I''d want to see more of the front of the truck, but then I shouldn''t because that would detract from the wheels and the challenge specifically is about the wheels...  So how you''ve composed / cropped the shot is right for the challenge, but maybe not right for the image?  it''s a good shot though, and it''s interesting and attention grabbing.  7.</td>', 'I feel bad for the owner of the truck, but hey, I do like the photo!  I''m not always a fan of going B&W, but i think in this case it kind of works...  I''d want to see more of the front of the truck, but then I shouldn''t because that would detract from the wheels and the challenge specifically is about the wheels...  So how you''ve composed / cropped the shot is right for the challenge, but maybe not right for the image?  it''s a good shot though, and it''s interesting and attention grabbing.  7.', '2004-04-07 18:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(658117, 68756, 18233, '<td valign="top">Great texture!!!</td>', 'Great texture!!!', '2004-04-07 18:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(658125, 68603, 9949, '<td valign="top">My favourite wheel picture. Nice job, a 9</td>', 'My favourite wheel picture. Nice job, a 9', '2004-04-07 18:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(658126, 68580, 16004, '<td valign="top">Favourite element of this - the colours.  So bright and bold!<br/> <br/>Least favourite element - the background.  To me, being subjective and probably wrong on this, the Depth of field seems a tiny bit awry, clashing somewhat with the excellent sharpness of the wheel in the foreground.  Does that make sense to you?  I think the sudden impact of the DOF might have been lessened if it were cropped a little more on the left.  Still, it is a good shot, the focus is (rightly) on the wheel...  I wonder what the wheels are a part of...?  hmmm.  7.</td>', 'Favourite element of this - the colours.  So bright and bold! Least favourite element - the background.  To me, being subjective and probably wrong on this, the Depth of field seems a tiny bit awry, clashing somewhat with the excellent sharpness of the wheel in the foreground.  Does that make sense to you?  I think the sudden impact of the DOF might have been lessened if it were cropped a little more on the left.  Still, it is a good shot, the focus is (rightly) on the wheel...  I wonder what the wheels are a part of...?  hmmm.  7.', '2004-04-07 18:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(658131, 68684, 16965, '<td valign="top">focus is not on the ''wheels''....  nice image and great composition.</td>', 'focus is not on the ''wheels''....  nice image and great composition.', '2004-04-07 18:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(658132, 68010, 16965, '<td valign="top">the dirty / pearled fender is distracting.  great colors on the sand...</td>', 'the dirty / pearled fender is distracting.  great colors on the sand...', '2004-04-07 18:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(658133, 68545, 16488, '<td valign="top">Very sculptural.  I like the fresh look at a common item.</td>', 'Very sculptural.  I like the fresh look at a common item.', '2004-04-07 18:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(658134, 68763, 16965, '<td valign="top">the strong DOF is distracting, as is the bright color in the bottom-right.</td>', 'the strong DOF is distracting, as is the bright color in the bottom-right.', '2004-04-07 18:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(658135, 68274, 16488, '<td valign="top">NIce!  The harsh light helps make it work.</td>', 'NIce!  The harsh light helps make it work.', '2004-04-07 18:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(658136, 68747, 16965, '<td valign="top">I would suggest better lighting to avoid the over-exposed spot on the right.</td>', 'I would suggest better lighting to avoid the over-exposed spot on the right.', '2004-04-07 18:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(658138, 68192, 16965, '<td valign="top">nice shot, nice composition.  the washed out sky is eye-catching when it shouldn''t be.</td>', 'nice shot, nice composition.  the washed out sky is eye-catching when it shouldn''t be.', '2004-04-07 18:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(658140, 68711, 16965, '<td valign="top">tires aren''t wheels :)  (not points lost for that).  The shot is a bit strange; static.  Maybe a tighter crop, or a shot with the plastic flapping around would have brought more interest into this shot.</td>', 'tires aren''t wheels :)  (not points lost for that).  The shot is a bit strange; static.  Maybe a tighter crop, or a shot with the plastic flapping around would have brought more interest into this shot.', '2004-04-07 18:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(658144, 68471, 16965, '<td valign="top">the focus is off, or the shutter should have been faster.  the dull brown leads to an uninteresting shot.  I keep wanting to read the ''fact'' sign to find more depth</td>', 'the focus is off, or the shutter should have been faster.  the dull brown leads to an uninteresting shot.  I keep wanting to read the ''fact'' sign to find more depth', '2004-04-07 18:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(658147, 68162, 16965, '<td valign="top">maybe a wider crop including the hub of this wheel would have given it a stronger wheel feeling.  Great shot, and perfect composition, but not very strong as a wheel.</td>', 'maybe a wider crop including the hub of this wheel would have given it a stronger wheel feeling.  Great shot, and perfect composition, but not very strong as a wheel.', '2004-04-07 18:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(658148, 68760, 16965, '<td valign="top">the hot spots on the leaves are distracting, and subject should have been fill-flashed to combat the backlight.</td>', 'the hot spots on the leaves are distracting, and subject should have been fill-flashed to combat the backlight.', '2004-04-07 18:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
