(658178, 68661, 544, '<td valign="top">This shots makes me laugh; good work. I like the tightness of the shot - adds a bit to the title - but it seems to be lacking in texture somehow... maybe a better manual focus would have helped... Also, it''s a bit hard to determine where you are in the shot. It doesn''t jump at you (so to speak). I can see that hurting you as people glance and vote without really examining and figuring out the shot.</td>', 'This shots makes me laugh; good work. I like the tightness of the shot - adds a bit to the title - but it seems to be lacking in texture somehow... maybe a better manual focus would have helped... Also, it''s a bit hard to determine where you are in the shot. It doesn''t jump at you (so to speak). I can see that hurting you as people glance and vote without really examining and figuring out the shot.', '2004-04-07 19:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(658180, 68735, 16488, '<td valign="top">Love the concept.  Would prefer a little more sand at the bottom.</td>', 'Love the concept.  Would prefer a little more sand at the bottom.', '2004-04-07 19:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(658182, 68218, 16965, '<td valign="top">focus is almost completely lost, exept for the sign in the background.  I''m not sure if that is supposed to be the focus of the image or not, but my attention is drawn to it.  the bright pattern in the upper right is eye-catching too.</td>', 'focus is almost completely lost, exept for the sign in the background.  I''m not sure if that is supposed to be the focus of the image or not, but my attention is drawn to it.  the bright pattern in the upper right is eye-catching too.', '2004-04-07 19:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(658184, 68712, 16488, '<td valign="top">Contrast of new and old very nice.  Large shadow detracts from overall composition.</td>', 'Contrast of new and old very nice.  Large shadow detracts from overall composition.', '2004-04-07 19:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(658186, 68761, 544, '<td valign="top">Oh man, this one is too bleached out. I think the all-white with black wheels is a good idea, but the black wheels aren''t really black, and don''t seem to have much texture. If you could have done that, I think the shot might have played out better. Maybe a more interesting angle and cropping on the car as well could have helped it.</td>', 'Oh man, this one is too bleached out. I think the all-white with black wheels is a good idea, but the black wheels aren''t really black, and don''t seem to have much texture. If you could have done that, I think the shot might have played out better. Maybe a more interesting angle and cropping on the car as well could have helped it.', '2004-04-07 19:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(658189, 68741, 16488, '<td valign="top">Crisp and poster-like.  In this case, the part does tell the story.</td>', 'Crisp and poster-like.  In this case, the part does tell the story.', '2004-04-07 19:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(658191, 67993, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice light, texture and abstraction.  Wish the image took in more up to down, though.</td>', 'Nice light, texture and abstraction.  Wish the image took in more up to down, though.', '2004-04-07 19:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(658195, 68679, 16488, '<td valign="top">Subtle!  Perhaps one good example of when blowing out the white works for the subject.</td>', 'Subtle!  Perhaps one good example of when blowing out the white works for the subject.', '2004-04-07 19:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(658196, 68589, 16488, '<td valign="top">Hope you''ll put a "How''d they do that" up on this one!</td>', 'Hope you''ll put a "How''d they do that" up on this one!', '2004-04-07 19:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
