(658205, 67957, 18374, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a little more DOF.  It is distracting having the back edge of the wheel out of focus.  Nice lighting and contrasts.</td>', 'I would have preferred a little more DOF.  It is distracting having the back edge of the wheel out of focus.  Nice lighting and contrasts.', '2004-04-07 19:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(658206, 68662, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Range of lights and darks is good.  Shadow from flash makes this less than perfect.  Didn''t mark you down for the title, but it seems a little inappropriate for a well greased machine...</td>', 'Interesting subject. Range of lights and darks is good.  Shadow from flash makes this less than perfect.  Didn''t mark you down for the title, but it seems a little inappropriate for a well greased machine...', '2004-04-07 19:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
