(659086, 68679, 4338, '<td valign="top">ok, I amit I had to save this image to my PC and edit it to find out what the heck it was....its a mouse. Very nicely done. Also I originally rated this a 5 since I did not know or how wheel fit this image. Im going to bump your score up to a 10</td>', 'ok, I amit I had to save this image to my PC and edit it to find out what the heck it was....its a mouse. Very nicely done. Also I originally rated this a 5 since I did not know or how wheel fit this image. Im going to bump your score up to a 10', '2004-04-08 02:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
