(659088, 68716, 9089, '<td valign="top">Picture would have been better with the lighting at a different angle.  With all of the bikes being in shadow and the sky being overblown, makes what could have been a great photo into a mediocre one.</td>', 'Picture would have been better with the lighting at a different angle.  With all of the bikes being in shadow and the sky being overblown, makes what could have been a great photo into a mediocre one.', '2004-04-08 02:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(659092, 67807, 9089, '<td valign="top">Picture is too cluttered with no focus for me, my eyes keep wandering from the camera to the wheel, to the other wheel, to the red title on the book, and back around.  Needs some central focus for my eyes not to get tired.</td>', 'Picture is too cluttered with no focus for me, my eyes keep wandering from the camera to the wheel, to the other wheel, to the red title on the book, and back around.  Needs some central focus for my eyes not to get tired.', '2004-04-08 02:52:51.000000', NULL, 1);
