(659289, 67769, 18868, '<td valign="top">LOL -- good interpretation of the challenge.  I might suggest that moving the subject off-center might be a touch more interesting.  Technically nice -- well lit, sharp, pleasing DOF.</td>', 'LOL -- good interpretation of the challenge.  I might suggest that moving the subject off-center might be a touch more interesting.  Technically nice -- well lit, sharp, pleasing DOF.', '2004-04-08 10:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
