(659291, 68028, 5364, '<td valign="top">Nice wheels, but to me, it crys-out to be made into a black and white image as there is no useful colour information here - just some great textures.</td>', 'Nice wheels, but to me, it crys-out to be made into a black and white image as there is no useful colour information here - just some great textures.', '2004-04-08 10:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
