(659297, 68190, 19744, '<td valign="top">You framed the wheels very nicely with the dead trees which is good for composition but the wheels don''t have enough contrast to that white sky imho.</td>', 'You framed the wheels very nicely with the dead trees which is good for composition but the wheels don''t have enough contrast to that white sky imho.', '2004-04-08 10:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
