(659300, 68767, 19744, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with that almost diagonal wheel in front. but it is overexposed. Otherwise this is more the metal "stripes" in the wheel than wheels. (sorry my english)</td>', 'Nice composition with that almost diagonal wheel in front. but it is overexposed. Otherwise this is more the metal "stripes" in the wheel than wheels. (sorry my english)', '2004-04-08 10:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(659301, 68006, 19744, '<td valign="top">A study how to use DOF, but we don''t get much of the wheel for this subject matter.</td>', 'A study how to use DOF, but we don''t get much of the wheel for this subject matter.', '2004-04-08 10:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(659303, 68269, 19744, '<td valign="top">The sky performed very nice for you. The idea is also good, but it is overexposed especially the skin. Composition is good with that big wheel coming in from the upper right.</td>', 'The sky performed very nice for you. The idea is also good, but it is overexposed especially the skin. Composition is good with that big wheel coming in from the upper right.', '2004-04-08 10:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(659304, 67911, 18868, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I''m an aficianado of time-lapse shots of carnivals (small group, eh?) and you''ve really caught the motion nicely.  Did you use a tripod?  Nitpicking, but it seems like some things are nicely sharp (the checkered canopy) but other things aren''t so sharp (the mini-indy sign).  Perhaps different USM settings would yield more uniform sharpness?</td>', 'Very nice!  I''m an aficianado of time-lapse shots of carnivals (small group, eh?) and you''ve really caught the motion nicely.  Did you use a tripod?  Nitpicking, but it seems like some things are nicely sharp (the checkered canopy) but other things aren''t so sharp (the mini-indy sign).  Perhaps different USM settings would yield more uniform sharpness?', '2004-04-08 10:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(659306, 68594, 10799, '<td valign="top">The only thing I would suggest is to have the model remove the watch.  The watch does not seem to fit with the time period your photo evokes.</td>', 'The only thing I would suggest is to have the model remove the watch.  The watch does not seem to fit with the time period your photo evokes.', '2004-04-08 10:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(659312, 68311, 16004, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot, reminds me of Jurassic Park for some reason, but it, to me, doesn''t seem wheely enough to fit the spirit of the challenge.  The only other thing I would note is that it might have been helped by a slight uplift in contrast as the colours look a little muted...    Just occured to me that is probably because it''s misty, so scratch that thought.  8.</td>', 'It''s a great shot, reminds me of Jurassic Park for some reason, but it, to me, doesn''t seem wheely enough to fit the spirit of the challenge.  The only other thing I would note is that it might have been helped by a slight uplift in contrast as the colours look a little muted...    Just occured to me that is probably because it''s misty, so scratch that thought.  8.', '2004-04-08 10:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
