(659514, 68668, 19809, '<td valign="top">This picture reminded me of my childhood. I can remember my father rolling prior to sowing the lawn in our new house. It was all so exciting. So, the good thing about this pciture is that the eye is drawn to the roller and then into the rest of the image and for me the emotions it rekindled.</td>', 'This picture reminded me of my childhood. I can remember my father rolling prior to sowing the lawn in our new house. It was all so exciting. So, the good thing about this pciture is that the eye is drawn to the roller and then into the rest of the image and for me the emotions it rekindled.', '2004-04-08 12:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(659520, 68545, 19809, '<td valign="top">Striking, clever idea. Simple, but stands out.</td>', 'Striking, clever idea. Simple, but stands out.', '2004-04-08 12:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
