(659524, 68269, 16402, '<td valign="top">Cute. Fence is very distracting though. Maybe you could have gotten a small box or stepping stool or something to stand on, thereby putting you a bit higher and the fence lower where it could be cropped out. Just a thought. Still a good job.</td>', 'Cute. Fence is very distracting though. Maybe you could have gotten a small box or stepping stool or something to stand on, thereby putting you a bit higher and the fence lower where it could be cropped out. Just a thought. Still a good job.', '2004-04-08 12:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(659548, 67911, 16402, '<td valign="top">Composition doesn''t really thrill me. Think I''d have approached it from a different angle, but great exposure and motion blur.</td>', 'Composition doesn''t really thrill me. Think I''d have approached it from a different angle, but great exposure and motion blur.', '2004-04-08 12:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
