(660395, 68588, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think most of people here are not very found of color-inverted pictures, Could have looked good if you just converted it to black and white,  judging from the blackness of the photo it might have been a little overexposured, you should try use the manual settings on your camera (if you can and if you dont) So that the photo can be more like what you want it to be, inverting is not saving it.. best of luck in future challenges :)</td>', 'I think most of people here are not very found of color-inverted pictures, Could have looked good if you just converted it to black and white,  judging from the blackness of the photo it might have been a little overexposured, you should try use the manual settings on your camera (if you can and if you dont) So that the photo can be more like what you want it to be, inverting is not saving it.. best of luck in future challenges :)', '2004-04-08 22:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
