(660427, 68738, 16488, '<td valign="top">If the string were crisp this would work for me in b&amp;w.  But without that, I want to see color--something neon so it really glows.  (just the way I see it)</td>', 'If the string were crisp this would work for me in b&w.  But without that, I want to see color--something neon so it really glows.  (just the way I see it)', '2004-04-08 23:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(660429, 68125, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like this shot even though I think it just skirts the challenge. Not much wheel showing, but what is here is beautiful. The color balance between the rust and the blue green of the door are just perfect. Good composition, clever play withthe rule of thirds, one of my favorites, which is often the kiss of death for ribbon contenders.</td>', 'I like this shot even though I think it just skirts the challenge. Not much wheel showing, but what is here is beautiful. The color balance between the rust and the blue green of the door are just perfect. Good composition, clever play withthe rule of thirds, one of my favorites, which is often the kiss of death for ribbon contenders.', '2004-04-08 23:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(660435, 68615, 16106, '<td valign="top">Dark, weird and very different. Should be a ribbon contender. I am so glad you didn''t desat this to B&amp;W, it would have stolen it''s magic. the shift between the distorted world of color and life contrasts with the metal world of the dead.</td>', 'Dark, weird and very different. Should be a ribbon contender. I am so glad you didn''t desat this to B&W, it would have stolen it''s magic. the shift between the distorted world of color and life contrasts with the metal world of the dead.', '2004-04-08 23:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(660440, 67929, 18846, '<td valign="top">nice shot... like a fantasy...<br/>nice title also</td>', 'nice shot... like a fantasy...nice title also', '2004-04-08 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(660443, 68651, 17551, '<td valign="top">sprinklers? nice capture</td>', 'sprinklers? nice capture', '2004-04-08 23:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(660447, 68118, 17551, '<td valign="top">interesting composition, but subject doesn''t really hold interest for long.. 5</td>', 'interesting composition, but subject doesn''t really hold interest for long.. 5', '2004-04-08 23:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(660450, 68735, 17551, '<td valign="top">nicely arranged, and the still one in the centre is a good idea. The lighting on the right hand side seems darker than the left side, perhaps repositioning is needed. Good! 7</td>', 'nicely arranged, and the still one in the centre is a good idea. The lighting on the right hand side seems darker than the left side, perhaps repositioning is needed. Good! 7', '2004-04-08 23:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(660451, 68339, 17551, '<td valign="top">nice capture of a locomotive wheel, except that partial shadow would have been better without</td>', 'nice capture of a locomotive wheel, except that partial shadow would have been better without', '2004-04-08 23:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(660453, 68588, 17551, '<td valign="top">negative image just a little too harsh for me</td>', 'negative image just a little too harsh for me', '2004-04-08 23:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(660454, 68293, 17551, '<td valign="top">good choice of B/W, shadow is distracting though.</td>', 'good choice of B/W, shadow is distracting though.', '2004-04-08 23:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
