(660462, 67895, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m givin'' the benefit of a doubt on this one.  Nice tones.  What did ya use for a background?<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m givin'' the benefit of a doubt on this one.  Nice tones.  What did ya use for a background?TC', '2004-04-08 23:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(660463, 68399, 18846, '<td valign="top">there is a very cold and dark feeling coming from this shot; it''s good for a thriller movie! ... too centered, too cold</td>', 'there is a very cold and dark feeling coming from this shot; it''s good for a thriller movie! ... too centered, too cold', '2004-04-08 23:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(660465, 68686, 17551, '<td valign="top">model construction set eh?</td>', 'model construction set eh?', '2004-04-08 23:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(660467, 68747, 17551, '<td valign="top">need a larger DOF</td>', 'need a larger DOF', '2004-04-08 23:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(660471, 68483, 9906, '<td valign="top">i know what you are trying to do with this shot, but the harsh lighting and un-necesary elements (two fences, a driveway, big rocks, flowers) make for a busy and confusing image.<br/>TC</td>', 'i know what you are trying to do with this shot, but the harsh lighting and un-necesary elements (two fences, a driveway, big rocks, flowers) make for a busy and confusing image.TC', '2004-04-08 23:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(660474, 68655, 17551, '<td valign="top">fantastic capture of an obtuse subject.. 9</td>', 'fantastic capture of an obtuse subject.. 9', '2004-04-08 23:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(660475, 68344, 9906, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if someone would do cheese wheels.  This appears to be overesposed (very bright.)  It also has some un needed elements.  Is this a market?  If so a different angle and tighter framing would help block out some things that you don''t need.<br/>TC</td>', 'I was wondering if someone would do cheese wheels.  This appears to be overesposed (very bright.)  It also has some un needed elements.  Is this a market?  If so a different angle and tighter framing would help block out some things that you don''t need.TC', '2004-04-08 23:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(660477, 68657, 17551, '<td valign="top">composition needs work and focus is not there... there are similiar ideas which have worked well, but this needs a bit of work</td>', 'composition needs work and focus is not there... there are similiar ideas which have worked well, but this needs a bit of work', '2004-04-08 23:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(660478, 68119, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and angle!  This appears to be shot during a time of rather harsh lighting.  A different time of day would have evened out the lighting a little making it appear more even across the image.  The blown out parts in the background on both sides are a little distracting.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice composition and angle!  This appears to be shot during a time of rather harsh lighting.  A different time of day would have evened out the lighting a little making it appear more even across the image.  The blown out parts in the background on both sides are a little distracting.TC', '2004-04-08 23:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(660479, 68194, 17551, '<td valign="top">lol.. technically quite good, except the skin is a bit over exposed</td>', 'lol.. technically quite good, except the skin is a bit over exposed', '2004-04-08 23:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(660483, 68117, 17551, '<td valign="top">I find that using this perspective, but at a higher angle, the WRX looks much better and aggressive.</td>', 'I find that using this perspective, but at a higher angle, the WRX looks much better and aggressive.', '2004-04-08 23:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(660486, 67993, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome tones and rustic feeling here.  It''s a little busy, but each element seems to have a home.  It looks like it is framed wrong though.  My eye wants to go to elements that are below or to the right of the frame.  Not seeing the whole scene, I do not know if a different angle would help to alleviate this.  If this is a cropped version  I would LOVE to see the whole thing.  If it is not, I would love to see it re-shot so that you have the windows in their entirety and the whole rope triangle going down  included in the frame.  Lovely spot to study.  Hope to see more if possible!<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome tones and rustic feeling here.  It''s a little busy, but each element seems to have a home.  It looks like it is framed wrong though.  My eye wants to go to elements that are below or to the right of the frame.  Not seeing the whole scene, I do not know if a different angle would help to alleviate this.  If this is a cropped version  I would LOVE to see the whole thing.  If it is not, I would love to see it re-shot so that you have the windows in their entirety and the whole rope triangle going down  included in the frame.  Lovely spot to study.  Hope to see more if possible!TC', '2004-04-08 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(660487, 68712, 9906, '<td valign="top">LIghting is too harsh making your highlites to bright and your shadows too dark.  A different time of day would make this shot really pop.  If a re-shoot is possible I would suggest early morning or later in the evening depending on how the scene lines up.<br/>TC</td>', 'LIghting is too harsh making your highlites to bright and your shadows too dark.  A different time of day would make this shot really pop.  If a re-shoot is possible I would suggest early morning or later in the evening depending on how the scene lines up.TC', '2004-04-08 23:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(660488, 68662, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen comments before where people say that the shot is cropped too tight.  With this shot that is the first thing that pops into my head.  You have reasonably nice lighting and the focus is good, but the composition doesn''t look ''right''.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''ve seen comments before where people say that the shot is cropped too tight.  With this shot that is the first thing that pops into my head.  You have reasonably nice lighting and the focus is good, but the composition doesn''t look ''right''.TC', '2004-04-08 23:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(660489, 68144, 9906, '<td valign="top">I think you got it backwards.  It''s a piston driven wheel...<br/>TC</td>', 'I think you got it backwards.  It''s a piston driven wheel...TC', '2004-04-08 23:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(660490, 68693, 18846, '<td valign="top">nice, very very clinically sharp shot... but too centered....</td>', 'nice, very very clinically sharp shot... but too centered....', '2004-04-08 23:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(660496, 67631, 18846, '<td valign="top">simple and not that bad...<br/>try to put a story behind it... and it might work...</td>', 'simple and not that bad...try to put a story behind it... and it might work...', '2004-04-08 23:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(660497, 68507, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice job of framing within the frame.  I think that would make a good challenge even.  Think I''ll suggest it!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice job of framing within the frame.  I think that would make a good challenge even.  Think I''ll suggest it!TC', '2004-04-08 23:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(660499, 67631, 19841, '<td valign="top">That''s a nice,  dynamic composition.  The shadow cast by the gears onto the background makes the bottom edge ambiguous, though.   Putting the flash in a different place would do the trick.</td>', 'That''s a nice,  dynamic composition.  The shadow cast by the gears onto the background makes the bottom edge ambiguous, though.   Putting the flash in a different place would do the trick.', '2004-04-08 23:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(660500, 68529, 18846, '<td valign="top">i like it<br/>it''s kind of chopped; i would have liked to see more of the wheel... but i like it... and u could have thought of a better title for it, more creative</td>', 'i like itit''s kind of chopped; i would have liked to see more of the wheel... but i like it... and u could have thought of a better title for it, more creative', '2004-04-08 23:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(660508, 68117, 18846, '<td valign="top">nice car...<br/>but no wheel story here...<br/>no title helping the shot...<br/>and it a bit blurred</td>', 'nice car...but no wheel story here...no title helping the shot...and it a bit blurred', '2004-04-08 23:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(660511, 67941, 18846, '<td valign="top">ok... it''s better than others... but... it''s not clear enough, it lacks creativity in title and composition... sharpness and light...<br/></td>', 'ok... it''s better than others... but... it''s not clear enough, it lacks creativity in title and composition... sharpness and light...', '2004-04-09 00:01:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(660512, 68661, 19841, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to figure out what this was.   It''s a creative idea, but the composition falls a little flat.  The verticals, horizontals and diagonals all cancel each other out, making a rather static image.   If you try cropping off about a third of the bottom, you get a more dynamic image.  The more strongly  horizontal shape gives the horizontal lines just enough more strength.</td>', 'It took me a while to figure out what this was.   It''s a creative idea, but the composition falls a little flat.  The verticals, horizontals and diagonals all cancel each other out, making a rather static image.   If you try cropping off about a third of the bottom, you get a more dynamic image.  The more strongly  horizontal shape gives the horizontal lines just enough more strength.', '2004-04-09 00:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(660515, 67964, 19841, '<td valign="top">This is much more elegant than the other one (got space?)</td>', 'This is much more elegant than the other one (got space?)', '2004-04-09 00:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(660516, 68449, 19842, '<td valign="top">not much wheel....</td>', 'not much wheel....', '2004-04-09 00:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(660517, 68483, 18846, '<td valign="top">this is a funny one...<br/>but somehow it does not work; the title does not help the composition and the movement of the pin wheel in this freezed frame... it just does not work. but nice try though</td>', 'this is a funny one...but somehow it does not work; the title does not help the composition and the movement of the pin wheel in this freezed frame... it just does not work. but nice try though', '2004-04-09 00:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(660518, 68485, 19842, '<td valign="top">very nice title</td>', 'very nice title', '2004-04-09 00:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(660521, 68731, 18846, '<td valign="top">This is a nice one as advertisment for Porshe...<br/>Crystal clear... quite nicely cut... but..this is not art</td>', 'This is a nice one as advertisment for Porshe...Crystal clear... quite nicely cut... but..this is not art', '2004-04-09 00:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(660525, 68719, 18846, '<td valign="top">Ok, the bikes have wheels... but if the wheels had the bikes it would have been even better since "wheels" are supposed to be the leading, not the supporting characters... <br/></td>', 'Ok, the bikes have wheels... but if the wheels had the bikes it would have been even better since "wheels" are supposed to be the leading, not the supporting characters... ', '2004-04-09 00:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(660526, 67807, 19841, '<td valign="top">The content is a bit contrived, but I won''t vote based on that.  What bugs me on this one is the loss of detail in the darks on the Canon camera.   Since it is in a prominent position in the composition, it seems that the exposure should have been set to show it off better.</td>', 'The content is a bit contrived, but I won''t vote based on that.  What bugs me on this one is the loss of detail in the darks on the Canon camera.   Since it is in a prominent position in the composition, it seems that the exposure should have been set to show it off better.', '2004-04-09 00:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(660527, 68714, 18846, '<td valign="top">u should try more creativity with the title; something like "wheel of mis-fortune" or something and that would help tremendously...<br/>like this is just an ugly truck with a flat tyre</td>', 'u should try more creativity with the title; something like "wheel of mis-fortune" or something and that would help tremendously...like this is just an ugly truck with a flat tyre', '2004-04-09 00:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(660529, 68164, 18846, '<td valign="top">Ok. I must admit I''ve never seen one (flight computer) but apart from the informative character of this shot... it does not bring anything....</td>', 'Ok. I must admit I''ve never seen one (flight computer) but apart from the informative character of this shot... it does not bring anything....', '2004-04-09 00:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(660532, 68260, 19841, '<td valign="top">If you want to get into documentary photography, you''re on the right track.  While this image isn''t something to hang over the fireplace with a spotlight on it, it is clear, well focused and exposed, and interesting to look at.</td>', 'If you want to get into documentary photography, you''re on the right track.  While this image isn''t something to hang over the fireplace with a spotlight on it, it is clear, well focused and exposed, and interesting to look at.', '2004-04-09 00:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(660533, 68276, 18846, '<td valign="top">Now, this is what I call an artistic shot... <br/>It does not have a phylosophic title, but it does not necessarily need one, because the shot itself had a tremendous descriptive value; it''s like a painting that does not require any special title; <br/>I like the war mood , very blueish,very cold...  the white wheels of the cannon which have the courage to be so white and so bold to stay there in a very belligerant and uncompromising position...ready to fire...<br/>Very nice job!<br/></td>', 'Now, this is what I call an artistic shot... It does not have a phylosophic title, but it does not necessarily need one, because the shot itself had a tremendous descriptive value; it''s like a painting that does not require any special title; I like the war mood , very blueish,very cold...  the white wheels of the cannon which have the courage to be so white and so bold to stay there in a very belligerant and uncompromising position...ready to fire...Very nice job!', '2004-04-09 00:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(660534, 68425, 19519, '<td valign="top">This photo seems blurry...Is it just me?</td>', 'This photo seems blurry...Is it just me?', '2004-04-09 00:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(660535, 67807, 19519, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept!</td>', 'Interesting concept!', '2004-04-09 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
