(660731, 68544, 16004, '<td valign="top">Composition (well, size and location of car compared to surroundings) is cracking.  I like the rushing lights, and the trees look pretty cool - it''s a good location you chose.  The picture itself isn''t that "wheely" to me - the car is a bit too head on...  Are those the standard golf headlights?  And why''d you take off the number plate?  Doesn''t matter, really.  It''s a good one, this one.  erm.  7.</td>', 'Composition (well, size and location of car compared to surroundings) is cracking.  I like the rushing lights, and the trees look pretty cool - it''s a good location you chose.  The picture itself isn''t that "wheely" to me - the car is a bit too head on...  Are those the standard golf headlights?  And why''d you take off the number plate?  Doesn''t matter, really.  It''s a good one, this one.  erm.  7.', '2004-04-09 09:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
