(660789, 67993, 1024, '<td valign="top">This photo brings a rush of nostalgia to me, it reminds me so much of my grandfathers workshop.  The muted colors add tremendously to this feel.  I gave only 2 10''s in this challenge and this was one of them.  I love this photograph and it is one that I would love to have hanging in my den.  Thank you for bringing back such warm memories.</td>', 'This photo brings a rush of nostalgia to me, it reminds me so much of my grandfathers workshop.  The muted colors add tremendously to this feel.  I gave only 2 10''s in this challenge and this was one of them.  I love this photograph and it is one that I would love to have hanging in my den.  Thank you for bringing back such warm memories.', '2004-04-09 10:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(660790, 68593, 19841, '<td valign="top">Even though the cup is round, I don''t see how the dregs of your lunchtime tea can be considered a wheel.</td>', 'Even though the cup is round, I don''t see how the dregs of your lunchtime tea can be considered a wheel.', '2004-04-09 10:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(660791, 68625, 1024, '<td valign="top">This photo brings back childhood memories to me, this is the sort of place you would see old men sitting in chairs, whittling and drinking "soda pop".  I love your use of speia here, it adds to the feeling of nostalgia.  This photo receives a 10 from me, one of only 2 I gave in this challenge.  Very well done.</td>', 'This photo brings back childhood memories to me, this is the sort of place you would see old men sitting in chairs, whittling and drinking "soda pop".  I love your use of speia here, it adds to the feeling of nostalgia.  This photo receives a 10 from me, one of only 2 I gave in this challenge.  Very well done.', '2004-04-09 10:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(660793, 68217, 19841, '<td valign="top">The long exposure really makes this interesting.</td>', 'The long exposure really makes this interesting.', '2004-04-09 10:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(660794, 68252, 1024, '<td valign="top">Your colors here are perfect, the dark sky sets off the orange glow of the rusty gears.  Very well done!</td>', 'Your colors here are perfect, the dark sky sets off the orange glow of the rusty gears.  Very well done!', '2004-04-09 10:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(660795, 68306, 1024, '<td valign="top">The only (very small) enhancement that I would make to this photograph is to have taken it at a slower speed to blur the water and the wheel.  Otherwise it is extemely well done.</td>', 'The only (very small) enhancement that I would make to this photograph is to have taken it at a slower speed to blur the water and the wheel.  Otherwise it is extemely well done.', '2004-04-09 10:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(660796, 68552, 1024, '<td valign="top">I am such a sucker for old mills with water wheels.  Where was this taken?</td>', 'I am such a sucker for old mills with water wheels.  Where was this taken?', '2004-04-09 10:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(660797, 68192, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very sharp details and great subject.</td>', 'Very sharp details and great subject.', '2004-04-09 10:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(660799, 68125, 1024, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter.  I very much like that the wheel is not overwhelming as the subject.  This adds to the artistic value of this photograph.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great subject matter.  I very much like that the wheel is not overwhelming as the subject.  This adds to the artistic value of this photograph.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-04-09 10:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(660800, 68617, 1024, '<td valign="top">Probably the most "artistic" of all the challenge entries.  I really like this, but I am afraid you took a big risk, and other voters might not see the absolute beauty in this photograph.  Well done!</td>', 'Probably the most "artistic" of all the challenge entries.  I really like this, but I am afraid you took a big risk, and other voters might not see the absolute beauty in this photograph.  Well done!', '2004-04-09 10:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(660802, 68194, 1024, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha, this is absolutely hilarious.  You took a big risk here, other voters might not see the "wheel" and vote you down.  Great job!</td>', 'Ha ha ha, this is absolutely hilarious.  You took a big risk here, other voters might not see the "wheel" and vote you down.  Great job!', '2004-04-09 10:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
