(661079, 68648, 19873, '<td valign="top">Very graphic and interesting pattern. The colors also jumps out at you.</td>', 'Very graphic and interesting pattern. The colors also jumps out at you.', '2004-04-09 16:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(661081, 68298, 19873, '<td valign="top">I like this photo because it is not just showing a wheel but a little more like the steps.</td>', 'I like this photo because it is not just showing a wheel but a little more like the steps.', '2004-04-09 16:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(661083, 68686, 19873, '<td valign="top">Unusual way to show wheels that is memorable.</td>', 'Unusual way to show wheels that is memorable.', '2004-04-09 16:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(661085, 68599, 19873, '<td valign="top">Eventhough there are a lot of hubcaps here, the Volkswagen one still stands out the most. Interesting photo!</td>', 'Eventhough there are a lot of hubcaps here, the Volkswagen one still stands out the most. Interesting photo!', '2004-04-09 16:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(661087, 68555, 19873, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern. I would have like the red under one of the wheel to be removed as it jars me a bit but otherwise good!</td>', 'Nice pattern. I would have like the red under one of the wheel to be removed as it jars me a bit but otherwise good!', '2004-04-09 16:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(661094, 67980, 19873, '<td valign="top">Nice complementary colors that work together well. Great photo!</td>', 'Nice complementary colors that work together well. Great photo!', '2004-04-09 16:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(661102, 68312, 16004, '<td valign="top">Technically I consider this to be a great shot - the colours are bright and bold,  focus is really good and overall, well executed.  The sky is a little bit dull, and the weather has made the mountains at the but a bit murky; but unless you''re a supreme being, there''s bog all that can be done about that.  My principal gripe is that the wheel element of this shot is purely incidental, and isn''t even that apparent.  Notwithstanding, I do consider this a great picture..</td>', 'Technically I consider this to be a great shot - the colours are bright and bold,  focus is really good and overall, well executed.  The sky is a little bit dull, and the weather has made the mountains at the but a bit murky; but unless you''re a supreme being, there''s bog all that can be done about that.  My principal gripe is that the wheel element of this shot is purely incidental, and isn''t even that apparent.  Notwithstanding, I do consider this a great picture..', '2004-04-09 16:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(661103, 68393, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp photo, but nothing I''d ever care to look at again.</td>', 'Nice, crisp photo, but nothing I''d ever care to look at again.', '2004-04-09 16:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(661105, 68739, 9941, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  Nice crop, good B &amp; W.</td>', 'This is cool.  Nice crop, good B & W.', '2004-04-09 16:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(661107, 68712, 16004, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - shame about the shadow filling half the frame, and on a personal note i would have liked to have seen more of a close up of the water wheel, which on it''s own is interesting.  The modern thing at the front adds a little too much clutter to the overall image and isn''t strictly necessary.</td>', 'Nice shot - shame about the shadow filling half the frame, and on a personal note i would have liked to have seen more of a close up of the water wheel, which on it''s own is interesting.  The modern thing at the front adds a little too much clutter to the overall image and isn''t strictly necessary.', '2004-04-09 16:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(661109, 68136, 16004, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter, but far too noisy for my preference.   And i think i might have rotated the image 5 or so degrees clockwise, so the trucks wheels and trailer  were more level.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter, but far too noisy for my preference.   And i think i might have rotated the image 5 or so degrees clockwise, so the trucks wheels and trailer  were more level.', '2004-04-09 16:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(661115, 68008, 16004, '<td valign="top">VERY pretty!  I love the colours and the lighting suits very well.  Creative and stylish, my only slight complaint is the ugly spindle in the middle (i wonder how it would look with that cropped out?), but that aside, a real attention grabber.  8.  Incidentally, this would have been a stonking shot for the motion blur!</td>', 'VERY pretty!  I love the colours and the lighting suits very well.  Creative and stylish, my only slight complaint is the ugly spindle in the middle (i wonder how it would look with that cropped out?), but that aside, a real attention grabber.  8.  Incidentally, this would have been a stonking shot for the motion blur!', '2004-04-09 16:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(661117, 68648, 16004, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the title - the image doesn''t really convey any sort of movement.  But i like the photo - nice and sharp, and the colours against the dark sky are very striking.  Interesting crop too.</td>', 'Not sure about the title - the image doesn''t really convey any sort of movement.  But i like the photo - nice and sharp, and the colours against the dark sky are very striking.  Interesting crop too.', '2004-04-09 16:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(661129, 68125, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture; i adore rusty trucks that have so much character.  Only you''ve gone and cropped out most of the wheel!  I so want to give this a high score...  The detail is unimprovable, though i might have wanted to rip the wing mirror off (the shadow is a bit of an unwelcomed distraction).  Sigh.  If the wheel factor wasn''t so important, 9.  But i have to knock a point off for excessive cropping of the thing that the subject is supposed to be about.  Sorry.  8.</td>', 'This is a great picture; i adore rusty trucks that have so much character.  Only you''ve gone and cropped out most of the wheel!  I so want to give this a high score...  The detail is unimprovable, though i might have wanted to rip the wing mirror off (the shadow is a bit of an unwelcomed distraction).  Sigh.  If the wheel factor wasn''t so important, 9.  But i have to knock a point off for excessive cropping of the thing that the subject is supposed to be about.  Sorry.  8.', '2004-04-09 17:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(661133, 68194, 16004, '<td valign="top">Well!  Let me give a breakdown of my score and i''ll award you the average.<br/> <br/>Humour / originality: - 10.  This is completely totally hilarious.  Well done you.<br/> <br/>Technical acheivement: - 9; focus, lighting, all other sundry bits all in check and pretty much without flaw.  The only preference i have is that i would have liked to have seen the image in landscape, thereby focusing more on the guy and the wheels and bringing it closer to me the viewer (though negative side effect is unfortunately losing the gorgeous sky and loevly moutain at the back)<br/> <br/>Being able to rope in some poor sod to make a tit of himself: - 10!  How''d you do it?  I hope you bought him a pint.  And then show his parents the picture!<br/> <br/>And fit the challenge? - 10.  Definitely, yes, no problem.  Unconventional but totally legit.<br/> <br/>So off the top of my head that''s a 9.75.  So 10!  well done!</td>', 'Well!  Let me give a breakdown of my score and i''ll award you the average. Humour / originality: - 10.  This is completely totally hilarious.  Well done you. Technical acheivement: - 9; focus, lighting, all other sundry bits all in check and pretty much without flaw.  The only preference i have is that i would have liked to have seen the image in landscape, thereby focusing more on the guy and the wheels and bringing it closer to me the viewer (though negative side effect is unfortunately losing the gorgeous sky and loevly moutain at the back) Being able to rope in some poor sod to make a tit of himself: - 10!  How''d you do it?  I hope you bought him a pint.  And then show his parents the picture! And fit the challenge? - 10.  Definitely, yes, no problem.  Unconventional but totally legit. So off the top of my head that''s a 9.75.  So 10!  well done!', '2004-04-09 17:27:58.000000', NULL, 1);
