(661266, 68117, 16004, '<td valign="top">Very gorgeous car and a fantastic set of wheels.  I especially like how you''ve managed to take a picture in an environment where the only colour left is that wonderful shocking blue.  The environment is also suitably perfect in a Mad Max post-apocalyptic kind of way.  The wheels are just about prominent / large enough to, in my mind, fill the criteria of the challenge (my eyes are automatically drawn to them) - and what great wheels they are too.  I hope you tell us what they are cause these would look brill on my silver saab.  My only slight recommendation would be to not crop quite so close to the front edge of the car.  Even so, this is one of my top 5 this week.  9.</td>', 'Very gorgeous car and a fantastic set of wheels.  I especially like how you''ve managed to take a picture in an environment where the only colour left is that wonderful shocking blue.  The environment is also suitably perfect in a Mad Max post-apocalyptic kind of way.  The wheels are just about prominent / large enough to, in my mind, fill the criteria of the challenge (my eyes are automatically drawn to them) - and what great wheels they are too.  I hope you tell us what they are cause these would look brill on my silver saab.  My only slight recommendation would be to not crop quite so close to the front edge of the car.  Even so, this is one of my top 5 this week.  9.', '2004-04-09 20:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
