(661331, 68443, 18505, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I like the fabric background and the textures in the wheel itself.  The colors are just slightly sepia on my monitor, which gives the pictures a wonderful tone, while allowing the interesting shapes and textures take center stage.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen a wheel like this with springs attached.  Wonderful picture.  I hope you do well in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I like the fabric background and the textures in the wheel itself.  The colors are just slightly sepia on my monitor, which gives the pictures a wonderful tone, while allowing the interesting shapes and textures take center stage.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen a wheel like this with springs attached.  Wonderful picture.  I hope you do well in the challenge.', '2004-04-09 21:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
