(661338, 68136, 18505, '<td valign="top">I like this picture and the subject.  The only thing I could think of which would have strengthened the picture (in my opinion) would have been to focus down more to include the bottom of the wheels in the lower part of the picture and cropped tighter on the left side to fill the frame with the top vehicle and the bottom tires.  It would have taken out most of the sky, but would have focused more on the wheels and camoflage.  Good luck in the challenge!!</td>', 'I like this picture and the subject.  The only thing I could think of which would have strengthened the picture (in my opinion) would have been to focus down more to include the bottom of the wheels in the lower part of the picture and cropped tighter on the left side to fill the frame with the top vehicle and the bottom tires.  It would have taken out most of the sky, but would have focused more on the wheels and camoflage.  Good luck in the challenge!!', '2004-04-09 21:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
