(661477, 68433, 19873, '<td valign="top">Looks like this has been around forever. Nice photo.</td>', 'Looks like this has been around forever. Nice photo.', '2004-04-10 00:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(661479, 68544, 19873, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo as we can see the lights from the other car moving by and the other has no driver in it. It is also interesting to note that there is not license plate on the car as well. Odd but interesting.</td>', 'Very interesting photo as we can see the lights from the other car moving by and the other has no driver in it. It is also interesting to note that there is not license plate on the car as well. Odd but interesting.', '2004-04-10 00:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(661480, 68246, 19873, '<td valign="top">Not a clean photo. The bike in front it distracts me from the line of bikes in the background.</td>', 'Not a clean photo. The bike in front it distracts me from the line of bikes in the background.', '2004-04-10 00:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(661481, 68252, 19873, '<td valign="top">Rich in colour and texture. The simple graphic shapes in this picture makes it stand out.</td>', 'Rich in colour and texture. The simple graphic shapes in this picture makes it stand out.', '2004-04-10 00:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(661482, 68508, 19873, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern that leads the eye to the last wheel that is slightly different from the rest.</td>', 'Interesting pattern that leads the eye to the last wheel that is slightly different from the rest.', '2004-04-10 01:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(661483, 68027, 19873, '<td valign="top">Bringing this monster truck down to scale has made it cuter than aggressive. Fun photo.</td>', 'Bringing this monster truck down to scale has made it cuter than aggressive. Fun photo.', '2004-04-10 01:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(661484, 68025, 19873, '<td valign="top">A bit messy and the focus is off.</td>', 'A bit messy and the focus is off.', '2004-04-10 01:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(661485, 67993, 19873, '<td valign="top">Charming and lovely photo. Interesting subject complemented by equally interesting background</td>', 'Charming and lovely photo. Interesting subject complemented by equally interesting background', '2004-04-10 01:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(661486, 68194, 19873, '<td valign="top">Humorous play on the 2001 theme.</td>', 'Humorous play on the 2001 theme.', '2004-04-10 01:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(661487, 68560, 19873, '<td valign="top">Nice rustic feel to this photo.</td>', 'Nice rustic feel to this photo.', '2004-04-10 01:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(661492, 68260, 19873, '<td valign="top">Nice wheel but I think the background does not complement it well. Maybe in a natural setting like hay or long tall brown grass would have been better.</td>', 'Nice wheel but I think the background does not complement it well. Maybe in a natural setting like hay or long tall brown grass would have been better.', '2004-04-10 01:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(661493, 68456, 18349, '<td valign="top">IMHO...too much sky and not enough wheel.</td>', 'IMHO...too much sky and not enough wheel.', '2004-04-10 01:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(661494, 67909, 19873, '<td valign="top">There is a nice country feeling from this photo. Nice work!</td>', 'There is a nice country feeling from this photo. Nice work!', '2004-04-10 01:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(661495, 68006, 18349, '<td valign="top">For me, too much of the wheel is out of focus...the intention is good, but I think the effect is lost.  Maybe a little more of an angle toward the center would have helped.</td>', 'For me, too much of the wheel is out of focus...the intention is good, but I think the effect is lost.  Maybe a little more of an angle toward the center would have helped.', '2004-04-10 01:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(661496, 68544, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting...but the brightness of the light behind the car is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Interesting...but the brightness of the light behind the car is a bit distracting.', '2004-04-10 01:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(661497, 68768, 18349, '<td valign="top">Pretty sunset</td>', 'Pretty sunset', '2004-04-10 01:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(661498, 68605, 19873, '<td valign="top">I think the photo should have been taken closer to have more impact. At the moment there is too much background and not enough of the subject to grab your attention. It is an interesting looking sculpture but I hope to see it a bit clearer.</td>', 'I think the photo should have been taken closer to have more impact. At the moment there is too much background and not enough of the subject to grab your attention. It is an interesting looking sculpture but I hope to see it a bit clearer.', '2004-04-10 01:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(661500, 68594, 18349, '<td valign="top">Something about this one just grabbed me...maybe the aged hands complimenting the aged wheels, or the roundness of the watch face complimenting the roundness of the wheels, or maybe the grainy and rough texture and how it helps one to feel the roughness of the metal.  Nice job.</td>', 'Something about this one just grabbed me...maybe the aged hands complimenting the aged wheels, or the roundness of the watch face complimenting the roundness of the wheels, or maybe the grainy and rough texture and how it helps one to feel the roughness of the metal.  Nice job.', '2004-04-10 01:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(661501, 68545, 18349, '<td valign="top">I guess that qualifies as a wheel.  Who''d a thunk it?</td>', 'I guess that qualifies as a wheel.  Who''d a thunk it?', '2004-04-10 01:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(661503, 68763, 18349, '<td valign="top">Colored carpet is a bit distracting, but I like the angle and the depth of field.</td>', 'Colored carpet is a bit distracting, but I like the angle and the depth of field.', '2004-04-10 01:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(661504, 67856, 18349, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and composition on this one.</td>', 'Love the angle and composition on this one.', '2004-04-10 01:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(661505, 68164, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the nostalgic feel to it.</td>', 'I like the nostalgic feel to it.', '2004-04-10 01:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
