(661778, 68584, 1570, '<td valign="top">this looks really good, nice and bright, 8.</td>', 'this looks really good, nice and bright, 8.', '2004-04-10 11:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(661788, 68311, 9089, '<td valign="top">Background background background, simply put the frontloader in the background blends right in with the jeep detracting from the picture, as do the wires coming out of the back of the jeep.</td>', 'Background background background, simply put the frontloader in the background blends right in with the jeep detracting from the picture, as do the wires coming out of the back of the jeep.', '2004-04-10 12:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(661789, 68589, 9089, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to decide that I liked this photo, the only thing I would have done differently is to rotate the wheel so the reflector is at the top, and the stem down toward the bottom, but that is minor, also, is that something wrapped in a paper towel under the wheel.</td>', 'It took me a while to decide that I liked this photo, the only thing I would have done differently is to rotate the wheel so the reflector is at the top, and the stem down toward the bottom, but that is minor, also, is that something wrapped in a paper towel under the wheel.', '2004-04-10 12:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(661797, 68348, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Festive.  I think this would benefit from a little more light on the closest pinwheel.  I like the contrasting texture of the background.  The light on the reflective surfaces seems to provide enough motion without actually spinning the subjects, but the overly birhgt whites seem to throw the composition out of balance.</td>', 'Nice.  Festive.  I think this would benefit from a little more light on the closest pinwheel.  I like the contrasting texture of the background.  The light on the reflective surfaces seems to provide enough motion without actually spinning the subjects, but the overly birhgt whites seem to throw the composition out of balance.', '2004-04-10 12:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(661802, 68289, 9089, '<td valign="top">Hard to have a sense of scale on these wheels, can''t tell if they are 6 feet tall, or toy wheels.</td>', 'Hard to have a sense of scale on these wheels, can''t tell if they are 6 feet tall, or toy wheels.', '2004-04-10 12:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(661803, 68366, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of crop.  Nice subject.  This has strong graphic qualities that are appealing.  The color is not my taste, but that''s just me.  The arrangement also makes this look more like a manhole cover than a church window...</td>', 'Interesting choice of crop.  Nice subject.  This has strong graphic qualities that are appealing.  The color is not my taste, but that''s just me.  The arrangement also makes this look more like a manhole cover than a church window...', '2004-04-10 12:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(661804, 68179, 11181, '<td valign="top">Photo seems small but i love the concept here! Very creative! Hope you do well! Good luck :D 9</td>', 'Photo seems small but i love the concept here! Very creative! Hope you do well! Good luck :D 9', '2004-04-10 12:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(661806, 68385, 9089, '<td valign="top">Better Title:  Daddy, I Fell</td>', 'Better Title:  Daddy, I Fell', '2004-04-10 12:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(661807, 68617, 16488, '<td valign="top">Like the point of view and the choice of subject.  I think the reflection of the statue detracts, though.  Not sure, but it might be better with a greater depth of field to bring the bike tires into focus.  B&amp;W appropriate for the subject.</td>', 'Like the point of view and the choice of subject.  I think the reflection of the statue detracts, though.  Not sure, but it might be better with a greater depth of field to bring the bike tires into focus.  B&W appropriate for the subject.', '2004-04-10 12:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(661809, 68734, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Probably the most unique take on a bike wheel in this challenge.   Overall it doesn''t grab me, though..  I wonder if there is a way to get more multiples of the wheel between the two to make this vibrate more?  Hope your comments reveal the set up for this one.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Probably the most unique take on a bike wheel in this challenge.   Overall it doesn''t grab me, though..  I wonder if there is a way to get more multiples of the wheel between the two to make this vibrate more?  Hope your comments reveal the set up for this one.', '2004-04-10 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(661811, 67895, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting.  The background breaks up a bit on my monitor.  I won''t dun you for it being a coin, but I do take exception to the title--just don''t think the Euro has yet gained the status of the economic force you imply.  Still, it''s a nice shot.  If I''d chosen this subject for the competition, I would have stood it on edge--but that''s my vision, not yours.....</td>', 'Nice color and lighting.  The background breaks up a bit on my monitor.  I won''t dun you for it being a coin, but I do take exception to the title--just don''t think the Euro has yet gained the status of the economic force you imply.  Still, it''s a nice shot.  If I''d chosen this subject for the competition, I would have stood it on edge--but that''s my vision, not yours.....', '2004-04-10 12:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(661813, 68150, 15810, '<td valign="top">gorgeous colours &amp; great composition. 9</td>', 'gorgeous colours & great composition. 9', '2004-04-10 12:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(661815, 68103, 16488, '<td valign="top">How many "it''s not a wheel''s" have you got?  The interesting parts of your subject (to me) are the blow-out and the word "warning".  I think a different angle and/or cropping could bring more attention to that.  Grass on the left is strong enough to detract from the subject.</td>', 'How many "it''s not a wheel''s" have you got?  The interesting parts of your subject (to me) are the blow-out and the word "warning".  I think a different angle and/or cropping could bring more attention to that.  Grass on the left is strong enough to detract from the subject.', '2004-04-10 12:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(661817, 68661, 16488, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!  There isn''t enough of the tread showing to really intimidate me--takes awhile to understand what this is and by then I''m not scared, the impact is lost.  I wonder if a similar composition on the vertical would work better?</td>', 'Cool idea!  There isn''t enough of the tread showing to really intimidate me--takes awhile to understand what this is and by then I''m not scared, the impact is lost.  I wonder if a similar composition on the vertical would work better?', '2004-04-10 12:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(661818, 68471, 15810, '<td valign="top">Depth of Field is a little too deep in this picture to make your "wheels" subject stand out yheu get kind of lost against the busy background.</td>', 'Depth of Field is a little too deep in this picture to make your "wheels" subject stand out yheu get kind of lost against the busy background.', '2004-04-10 12:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(661819, 68152, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Stands on its own.  Sepia and graininess feel right.  No real dark darks or bright brights--think a greater tonal range could improve this.</td>', 'Nice.  Stands on its own.  Sepia and graininess feel right.  No real dark darks or bright brights--think a greater tonal range could improve this.', '2004-04-10 12:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
