(661827, 68626, 16488, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s too small, but the contrast helps make up for it.  Nice point of view, and choice of lens angle.</td>', 'Yes, it''s too small, but the contrast helps make up for it.  Nice point of view, and choice of lens angle.', '2004-04-10 12:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
