(661840, 68537, 9089, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of all the train wheel photos of this challenge, lighting and coloration give a sense of richness of days gone past (when riding a train was a luxury).  Great shot.</td>', 'This is my favorite of all the train wheel photos of this challenge, lighting and coloration give a sense of richness of days gone past (when riding a train was a luxury).  Great shot.', '2004-04-10 12:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
