(661852, 68552, 16488, '<td valign="top">You picked a tough one given how well known this subject is.  I feel the color is flat rather than soft, but I''m afraid (other than waiting for a less overcast day) I don''t know how it could be improved from a technical standpoint.  Composition is o.k. though the horizontal seems off.  Wheel lacks emphasis due to lighting and lack of sharpness.  (Just my opinions, throw me a raspberry if you don''t agree.)</td>', 'You picked a tough one given how well known this subject is.  I feel the color is flat rather than soft, but I''m afraid (other than waiting for a less overcast day) I don''t know how it could be improved from a technical standpoint.  Composition is o.k. though the horizontal seems off.  Wheel lacks emphasis due to lighting and lack of sharpness.  (Just my opinions, throw me a raspberry if you don''t agree.)', '2004-04-10 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(661853, 68362, 9089, '<td valign="top">The guys in the background behind the wall keep taking my eyes away from the car and up to them.</td>', 'The guys in the background behind the wall keep taking my eyes away from the car and up to them.', '2004-04-10 13:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
