(662642, 68123, 15920, '<td valign="top">The extreme light at the top makes this really hard (I had the same problem.)  I like the idea that wheel is used a support in the picture rather than the subject.  A slightly higher shutter speed might have helped on both faces, but that is a judgment call.  Good luck. -7</td>', 'The extreme light at the top makes this really hard (I had the same problem.)  I like the idea that wheel is used a support in the picture rather than the subject.  A slightly higher shutter speed might have helped on both faces, but that is a judgment call.  Good luck. -7', '2004-04-11 05:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
