(662712, 68343, 14614, '<td valign="top">(My guess is you''re getting killed score wise -- :)  )  As far as the photo goes, you''ve arranged a nice color pallete here and dof adds nicely.  The white (baby''s breath??) detracts I think as there''s too much of it in the foreground.</td>', '(My guess is you''re getting killed score wise -- :)  )  As far as the photo goes, you''ve arranged a nice color pallete here and dof adds nicely.  The white (baby''s breath??) detracts I think as there''s too much of it in the foreground.', '2004-04-11 09:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(662714, 68152, 14614, '<td valign="top">you''ve created a nice feel by using the grainy b&amp;w sepia thing.  your care in framing out just what you found interesting helps me engage in your shot.  the flat lighting creates the overall mood -- well done</td>', 'you''ve created a nice feel by using the grainy b&w sepia thing.  your care in framing out just what you found interesting helps me engage in your shot.  the flat lighting creates the overall mood -- well done', '2004-04-11 09:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(662715, 68764, 14614, '<td valign="top">nice use of the accent color to hold my attention on your main subject, the other elements in the frame create a great story -- well done</td>', 'nice use of the accent color to hold my attention on your main subject, the other elements in the frame create a great story -- well done', '2004-04-11 09:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(662716, 68580, 14614, '<td valign="top">punchy color helps hold my interest, nice framing of the wheels - nicely done</td>', 'punchy color helps hold my interest, nice framing of the wheels - nicely done', '2004-04-11 09:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(662717, 68179, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the composition -- I hope it''s not a single sculpture but one you arranged -- if so, you''ve done an excellent job of creating an abstract collage that fits the theme.  I''d like to see the shot a bit bigger and perhaps with an interesting border.</td>', 'I like the composition -- I hope it''s not a single sculpture but one you arranged -- if so, you''ve done an excellent job of creating an abstract collage that fits the theme.  I''d like to see the shot a bit bigger and perhaps with an interesting border.', '2004-04-11 09:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(662722, 68772, 5792, '<td valign="top">Decent clarity and subject. Image would be better if far left distant background were cropped out of the image. It adds nothing to the composition but draws the eye away from the cart.</td>', 'Decent clarity and subject. Image would be better if far left distant background were cropped out of the image. It adds nothing to the composition but draws the eye away from the cart.', '2004-04-11 10:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(662725, 68159, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good composition</td>', 'Good composition', '2004-04-11 10:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(662731, 68597, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, color and tire composition. The image would be much improved without the truck.</td>', 'Great perspective, color and tire composition. The image would be much improved without the truck.', '2004-04-11 10:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(662739, 68552, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good subject, nicely cropped. I''d have saturated the reds and yellows as much as 40-60% (Maximum without noticeable oversaturation effects) with a little decreased brightness in the saturation to bring out more vibrant building colors and give it a more "New England" look.</td>', 'Good subject, nicely cropped. I''d have saturated the reds and yellows as much as 40-60% (Maximum without noticeable oversaturation effects) with a little decreased brightness in the saturation to bring out more vibrant building colors and give it a more "New England" look.', '2004-04-11 11:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(662741, 68260, 11895, '<td valign="top">background needs improvement</td>', 'background needs improvement', '2004-04-11 11:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(662742, 68679, 6532, '<td valign="top">Cool!  But, I cant really tell what it is.....</td>', 'Cool!  But, I cant really tell what it is.....', '2004-04-11 11:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(662750, 68164, 15920, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, and very well done.  Small improvements in DOF and lighting (cutting the overexposure on the highlights) might be possible. But, I definately like this. -9</td>', 'Interesting subject, and very well done.  Small improvements in DOF and lighting (cutting the overexposure on the highlights) might be possible. But, I definately like this. -9', '2004-04-11 11:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(662751, 68593, 1202, '<td valign="top">All things round don''t make me think wheel.  That is the case here.</td>', 'All things round don''t make me think wheel.  That is the case here.', '2004-04-11 11:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(662752, 68252, 15920, '<td valign="top">That looks more like a gear to me, but I really like the lighting and colors, so who cares.  A little sharper on the rust would have helped a little.</td>', 'That looks more like a gear to me, but I really like the lighting and colors, so who cares.  A little sharper on the rust would have helped a little.', '2004-04-11 11:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(662755, 68218, 1202, '<td valign="top">Very busy scene, but it doesn''t make me think wheel.</td>', 'Very busy scene, but it doesn''t make me think wheel.', '2004-04-11 11:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(662765, 67911, 19959, '<td valign="top">Excellent...</td>', 'Excellent...', '2004-04-11 12:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(662781, 68707, 14476, '<td valign="top">Just finishing up scoring the challenge and saw this.  It''s excellent and well worth a 10.  Good luck.</td>', 'Just finishing up scoring the challenge and saw this.  It''s excellent and well worth a 10.  Good luck.', '2004-04-11 12:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(662782, 68150, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully conceived and photographed image.  I hope you do well with it.  10</td>', 'This is a beautifully conceived and photographed image.  I hope you do well with it.  10', '2004-04-11 12:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(662783, 68252, 14476, '<td valign="top">I very much like the imaginative take on the Challenge you provide with this image.  It''s a work of art.  Good luck!   10</td>', 'I very much like the imaginative take on the Challenge you provide with this image.  It''s a work of art.  Good luck!   10', '2004-04-11 12:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
