(662932, 68605, 18403, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The glare of the sun in the clouds appears to be saturated, somewhat distracting.  The same photo from an angle to exclude the sun might improve the overall image, but the reflection on the water is great.  Not an easy subject!</td>', 'Nice composition. The glare of the sun in the clouds appears to be saturated, somewhat distracting.  The same photo from an angle to exclude the sun might improve the overall image, but the reflection on the water is great.  Not an easy subject!', '2004-04-11 18:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
