(662957, 68739, 13305, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. But I think I''d prefer the pic in either full color or all BW.  Possibly a sepia tone.  Good effort.  9</td>', 'I like the composition. But I think I''d prefer the pic in either full color or all BW.  Possibly a sepia tone.  Good effort.  9', '2004-04-11 19:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
