(662981, 68669, 13305, '<td valign="top">Different. Fairly plain in the context of this challenge.   I''d like a little less blur/light trail and more background.  Keep trying.</td>', 'Different. Fairly plain in the context of this challenge.   I''d like a little less blur/light trail and more background.  Keep trying.', '2004-04-11 20:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
