(663875, 68339, 20027, '<td valign="top">very nice attempt. very artistic lines and subtle coloring. shadows seem a bit strong. My eyes seen to strain to make out the right 2/3rds of the shot.</td>', 'very nice attempt. very artistic lines and subtle coloring. shadows seem a bit strong. My eyes seen to strain to make out the right 2/3rds of the shot.', '2004-04-12 15:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
