(663878, 68679, 12802, '<td valign="top">A very nice picture here!!!  Been showing it to a few collegues!<br/> <br/>I really like your lighting here, almost drowns out the rest of the mouse, whilst only showing the wheel (and button)  Was it done with a mirror?  Well done!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-13 14:53:54.</i></td>', 'A very nice picture here!!!  Been showing it to a few collegues! I really like your lighting here, almost drowns out the rest of the mouse, whilst only showing the wheel (and button)  Was it done with a mirror?  Well done!!', '2004-04-12 15:24:07.000000', '2004-10-13 15:53:54.000000', 1),
