(664289, 68456, 2333, '<td valign="top">An original composition, and a very nice color treatment. The rust-pocked texture of the wheels adds interest. The large DoF works well here, as does the hard light. The angled viewpoint gives the image an abstract look.<br/>Good work, and good luck!</td>', 'An original composition, and a very nice color treatment. The rust-pocked texture of the wheels adds interest. The large DoF works well here, as does the hard light. The angled viewpoint gives the image an abstract look.Good work, and good luck!', '2004-04-12 18:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
