(664389, 68762, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot really brings back memories.  I had skates like this when I was a kid.  If you lost the key you couldn''t use them because you couldn''t get them on your shoes.  Almost forgot about those things.  Oh and they never went very fast either.  Nice shot.  The only thing that to me detracts is the carpeting.  We always put them on in the garage on the concrete floor.<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot really brings back memories.  I had skates like this when I was a kid.  If you lost the key you couldn''t use them because you couldn''t get them on your shoes.  Almost forgot about those things.  Oh and they never went very fast either.  Nice shot.  The only thing that to me detracts is the carpeting.  We always put them on in the garage on the concrete floor.TC', '2004-04-12 18:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(664390, 68385, 18897, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and the face just says everything about riding that bike. Would have wanted some more wheels in the picture.<br/> <br/>Hope you gave her some comfort after cold-heartedly playing with your camera! :)</td>', 'Lovely colors and the face just says everything about riding that bike. Would have wanted some more wheels in the picture. Hope you gave her some comfort after cold-heartedly playing with your camera! :)', '2004-04-12 18:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
