(664408, 67647, 9906, '<td valign="top">THis shot makes me wonder how these obviously once useful wheels came to be in this state.  How were they used.  Were they for grinding?  What did they grind.  How many people were fed with the assistance of these wheels.  I wish I could see more of the area around the wheels.  Are they still of use today?  Are they holding up the bank of a river?  It would be kind of sad to go from a very important job (feeding the people) to something unappreciated...<br/>TC</td>', 'THis shot makes me wonder how these obviously once useful wheels came to be in this state.  How were they used.  Were they for grinding?  What did they grind.  How many people were fed with the assistance of these wheels.  I wish I could see more of the area around the wheels.  Are they still of use today?  Are they holding up the bank of a river?  It would be kind of sad to go from a very important job (feeding the people) to something unappreciated...TC', '2004-04-12 19:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
