(665680, 68028, 20075, '<td valign="top">This is creative - I think it would look even better if it had been taken at a different time of the day.</td>', 'This is creative - I think it would look even better if it had been taken at a different time of the day.', '2004-04-13 12:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(665681, 68262, 15919, '<td valign="top">Technically very well done, like the extreamly shallow DOF you are using.  Most often I think that photographing toy´s are not going to give good results on this site and often I dont find thous images creative.  But because of the overal quality of this image I think you are going to get away with it.</td>', 'Technically very well done, like the extreamly shallow DOF you are using.  Most often I think that photographing toy´s are not going to give good results on this site and often I dont find thous images creative.  But because of the overal quality of this image I think you are going to get away with it.', '2004-04-13 12:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(665682, 68541, 15919, '<td valign="top">Interesting image but I think it could tolerate a litle more contrast and sharpness.</td>', 'Interesting image but I think it could tolerate a litle more contrast and sharpness.', '2004-04-13 12:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(665683, 68589, 20075, '<td valign="top">Nice concept!</td>', 'Nice concept!', '2004-04-13 12:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(665686, 68768, 15919, '<td valign="top">Interesting silouette.  Think litle longer exposure would have been ok to lighten up the background sky.</td>', 'Interesting silouette.  Think litle longer exposure would have been ok to lighten up the background sky.', '2004-04-13 12:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(665690, 68362, 20075, '<td valign="top">Great racecar!  This is a shot I bet would look even better if the background had been blurred by motion (i.e.- pan the camera with the movement of the car so that the car remains clear while the background blurs).  Now, I''ve never done this successfully myself - it takes a lot of practice!  But just a suggestion.</td>', 'Great racecar!  This is a shot I bet would look even better if the background had been blurred by motion (i.e.- pan the camera with the movement of the car so that the car remains clear while the background blurs).  Now, I''ve never done this successfully myself - it takes a lot of practice!  But just a suggestion.', '2004-04-13 12:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(665696, 68687, 17446, '<td valign="top">man, this is pretty good, but i wish you would have not had the tripod in the final shot.</td>', 'man, this is pretty good, but i wish you would have not had the tripod in the final shot.', '2004-04-13 12:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(665702, 68437, 17446, '<td valign="top">what kind of bike is this?</td>', 'what kind of bike is this?', '2004-04-13 12:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(665703, 68274, 20075, '<td valign="top">Very whimsical - I like it!</td>', 'Very whimsical - I like it!', '2004-04-13 12:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(665705, 68734, 20075, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract</td>', 'interesting abstract', '2004-04-13 12:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(665711, 68399, 15919, '<td valign="top">Seems very contrasted and sharpened.  But it doesn´t destroy the image and gives it a creative effect.  Dont know what kind of wheels this is but the image is ok.</td>', 'Seems very contrasted and sharpened.  But it doesn´t destroy the image and gives it a creative effect.  Dont know what kind of wheels this is but the image is ok.', '2004-04-13 13:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
