(665781, 68772, 15919, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Think you should have give it a more croping form the left to exclude the rather distracting background there.  Or you should have shot this froma another angel, maybe litle closer.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Think you should have give it a more croping form the left to exclude the rather distracting background there.  Or you should have shot this froma another angel, maybe litle closer.', '2004-04-13 13:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
