(665784, 68772, 18960, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image and I am certain that the ''wheeled'' cart is a major contributing factor, so I would vote it high even though some people think the wheel itself should be a much greater percentage contributor to the image.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image and I am certain that the ''wheeled'' cart is a major contributing factor, so I would vote it high even though some people think the wheel itself should be a much greater percentage contributor to the image.', '2004-04-13 14:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
