(666365, 68443, 14614, '<td valign="top">This is soo close to great (from very good) -- the missing factor is DOF - the linen backdrop is too crisp and becomes an element in the shot.  That makes a competition for my attention from the wheel (an interesting one!).  The very front edge of the wheel (by the nut and white paint) is just oof (unfortuneattely right by the white paint that draws extra attention to it)  I offer these comments, of course, IMHO.</td>', 'This is soo close to great (from very good) -- the missing factor is DOF - the linen backdrop is too crisp and becomes an element in the shot.  That makes a competition for my attention from the wheel (an interesting one!).  The very front edge of the wheel (by the nut and white paint) is just oof (unfortuneattely right by the white paint that draws extra attention to it)  I offer these comments, of course, IMHO.', '2004-04-13 21:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
