(666912, 68603, 4008, '<td valign="top">Worked out really well, I like the raindrops adding extra sparkles. Just wondering how you attached the tripod to your door, it is such a smooth surface, did you do it with open window ? Front or back door ?<br/> <br/>You might want to check my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/how.php?HOW_ID=33" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">How''d they do that ?</a> for some different angles using a tripod on the front.</td>', 'Worked out really well, I like the raindrops adding extra sparkles. Just wondering how you attached the tripod to your door, it is such a smooth surface, did you do it with open window ? Front or back door ? You might want to check my How''d they do that ? for some different angles using a tripod on the front.', '2004-04-14 03:46:33.000000', NULL, 0),
