(667111, 68385, 13035, '<td valign="top">I gave this foto an 8, but your comment is out of line here.  Photography is subjective, and on this site, majority rules.  The subject of this picture is the girl, not the wheel.  It is encouraged here that we give maximum consideration to the theme.  That''s the dificulty of this challange oriented site.  Coming up with ideas twice a week that fit.  My guess is that many people didn''t think that it met the challange.  You are exactly right that this is a wonderful shot, but your playing long odds going 113 to 1.</td>', 'I gave this foto an 8, but your comment is out of line here.  Photography is subjective, and on this site, majority rules.  The subject of this picture is the girl, not the wheel.  It is encouraged here that we give maximum consideration to the theme.  That''s the dificulty of this challange oriented site.  Coming up with ideas twice a week that fit.  My guess is that many people didn''t think that it met the challange.  You are exactly right that this is a wonderful shot, but your playing long odds going 113 to 1.', '2004-04-14 06:40:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(667116, 68443, 19914, '<td valign="top">Hey, I''ve herad on forums you plan to give up shooting.... I rated your "wheel" a 9, so some of us are very near to your "taste", but others look more to the "impact"... I don''t really like the 3 winners, the didn''t get more than 6 from me, but all people, with different way of looking at photos vote, and "artistic" is not the most rated aspect most of the cases.<br/> <br/>Go on shooting!<br/> <br/>(my profile have no photo, my first try is in this "strenght" challenge... come to my profile next week to know witch one was mine ;)</td>', 'Hey, I''ve herad on forums you plan to give up shooting.... I rated your "wheel" a 9, so some of us are very near to your "taste", but others look more to the "impact"... I don''t really like the 3 winners, the didn''t get more than 6 from me, but all people, with different way of looking at photos vote, and "artistic" is not the most rated aspect most of the cases. Go on shooting! (my profile have no photo, my first try is in this "strenght" challenge... come to my profile next week to know witch one was mine ;)', '2004-04-14 06:44:08.000000', NULL, 0),
