(667397, 68731, 17937, '<td valign="top">Thanks.  I thought it was going to do better as well.  Guess it all depends on the majority of the voters however.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments.  <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by josevillacorte:</b></div><hr/><i> Whoah! This should have done alot better! I was hoping this would be somewhere in the top 10.. :(<br/> <br/>Extremely good composition, very professional... cropping is great, focus very crisp, lighting is perfect.<br/> <br/>Gave you a 10 on this.. better luck on the next challenge! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thanks.  I thought it was going to do better as well.  Guess it all depends on the majority of the voters however. Thanks for the comments.   Originally posted by josevillacorte: Whoah! This should have done alot better! I was hoping this would be somewhere in the top 10.. :( Extremely good composition, very professional... cropping is great, focus very crisp, lighting is perfect. Gave you a 10 on this.. better luck on the next challenge! ', '2004-04-14 09:55:41.000000', NULL, 0),
