(667489, 68038, 17492, '<td valign="top">I read in the forums you thought it was a unique shot. To me it says "I need a ''wheels'' photo in the next 15 minutes." Distractingly off center point. I think this would''ve done a LOT better had you made it vertical, and cropped at the dark line belows the grey top. <a href="//www.pepper-land.net/photos/net/dpc-wheels1.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Like so.</a></td>', 'I read in the forums you thought it was a unique shot. To me it says "I need a ''wheels'' photo in the next 15 minutes." Distractingly off center point. I think this would''ve done a LOT better had you made it vertical, and cropped at the dark line belows the grey top. Like so.', '2004-04-14 10:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
