(668630, 67895, 19333, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who spent his time comenting on the pic. You have been useful indeed!<br/> <br/>Maybe you cannot call it a wheel, but haven''t you seen any of these rolling down to its hidden place?. I wasn''t either trying to start a discussion about if it''s euro, dollar or whichever currency you happen to use, I just borrowed from Cabaret''s song "Money makes the world..."<br/> <br/>On the other hand, you cannot lay the blame on me about being unoriginal just because it''s a coin. Sure, there are lots of nickes and dimes around but... it''s the first EURO coin portrait here at DPC, AFAIK!!  :-DDD<br/></td>', 'Thank you to everyone who spent his time comenting on the pic. You have been useful indeed! Maybe you cannot call it a wheel, but haven''t you seen any of these rolling down to its hidden place?. I wasn''t either trying to start a discussion about if it''s euro, dollar or whichever currency you happen to use, I just borrowed from Cabaret''s song "Money makes the world..." On the other hand, you cannot lay the blame on me about being unoriginal just because it''s a coin. Sure, there are lots of nickes and dimes around but... it''s the first EURO coin portrait here at DPC, AFAIK!!  :-DDD', '2004-04-14 19:16:02.000000', NULL, 0),
