(669565, 68276, 12311, '<td valign="top">I appreciate all the good, helpful comments on my photo.  The building actually has a stair-like design on the left and right sides of the roof.  The facade is such that even a little sharpening brings out the mottled/speckled highlights.  <br/> <br/>I live about 30 minutes from Youngstown.  This historic building is just fascinating!<br/> <br/>Thanks to all!<br/> <br/>-len<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-18 16:46:17.</i></td>', 'I appreciate all the good, helpful comments on my photo.  The building actually has a stair-like design on the left and right sides of the roof.  The facade is such that even a little sharpening brings out the mottled/speckled highlights.   I live about 30 minutes from Youngstown.  This historic building is just fascinating! Thanks to all! -len', '2004-04-15 08:59:33.000000', '2004-04-18 17:46:17.000000', 0),
