(673331, 68118, 19519, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments, I appreciate getting the feedback.  I have a hard time getting feedback from anyone I know, as I do not know too many people interested in photography.  This was a great discovery for me.  In regards to the comment by TooCool, I tried it with more DOF, but didn''t like the results, I liked the offcentered feel, with all the focus on the left wheel.  I also thought, like dhare, that the subject would not hold interest, but I liked taking the photos, I used it as a kind of Depth of Focus study.  I took many shots with each wheel in focus, and all in focus, but this was my favorite out of the bunch.  In response to CVTJan and bpickard, I thought that if there was an out of focus wheel in the center, that it would work, which, to a certain extent, it did.  This is not my best work, as I had just found this web site, and had little time to think about the challenge.  I hope to do better in the future.  And, I do not normally have a theme to follow (this is just a hobby), which is precisely why I am trying to complete these challenges, to better myself.  Thank you, everyone, for your help!</td>', 'Thanks for your comments, I appreciate getting the feedback.  I have a hard time getting feedback from anyone I know, as I do not know too many people interested in photography.  This was a great discovery for me.  In regards to the comment by TooCool, I tried it with more DOF, but didn''t like the results, I liked the offcentered feel, with all the focus on the left wheel.  I also thought, like dhare, that the subject would not hold interest, but I liked taking the photos, I used it as a kind of Depth of Focus study.  I took many shots with each wheel in focus, and all in focus, but this was my favorite out of the bunch.  In response to CVTJan and bpickard, I thought that if there was an out of focus wheel in the center, that it would work, which, to a certain extent, it did.  This is not my best work, as I had just found this web site, and had little time to think about the challenge.  I hope to do better in the future.  And, I do not normally have a theme to follow (this is just a hobby), which is precisely why I am trying to complete these challenges, to better myself.  Thank you, everyone, for your help!', '2004-04-17 23:22:14.000000', NULL, 0),
