(1861809, 68609, 10858, '<td valign="top">Sure I know this is Momo, and it was designed by one of the Ferrari guys. There was also a sticker on the wheel which I cropped, because I found it distractive for the shot.</td>', 'Sure I know this is Momo, and it was designed by one of the Ferrari guys. There was also a sticker on the wheel which I cropped, because I found it distractive for the shot.', '2005-11-13 07:39:48.000000', NULL, 0),
